<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2KI" style="id">- POGORO BIBLE VERSION</book>
  <para style="h">Wafalumi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Shitabu sha pili sha Wafalumi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Wafalumi</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Wafa</para>
  <para style="mt2">Shitabu sha pili sha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Wafalumi</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGULERU</para>
  <para style="ip">Vitabu vya Wafalumi 1 na 2 shanjiru shimu shikulu kumbiti shibagulwa wega mbili, makashu kwa visoweru vya shigiliki, shitafusiliwa handa lipatanu ligona. Imanika ndili handa gaa kavilembiti vitabu vya wafalumi 1 na 2 mlemba gwa shitabu sha wafalumi katenderiti vinja vivuwa kushimalira shitabu ashi. Guloli 1 wafalumi 11: 41 na 14: 19 na 14: 29 kwa mfanu gumu viraa tuvimanandili shitabu ashi shilembitwi koshi ama shimalilitwi ndii, tulihola kuwera shilembitwi pa mfalumi Yehoniya pa kuleka ukulu mu shinja sha 561 B.C, toziya lilawiru ali litakula mu 2 wafalumi 25: 27. Wafunda wavuwa viraa wavimaniti shipandi shikulu sha vitabu avi vilembitwi vinja vivuwa vya makashu. Vitabu vya 1 mfalumi na 2 mfalumi shiyowelera kuusu kila mfalumi gwa Israeli na Yuda kulawa shaka sha mfalumi Sulemani, shaka shilii isi mbili ziweriti pamuhela, shitabu ashi shitakulira ntambu ya kubagulwa kwa Liboma lya mfalumi na kubagulwa kwa histoliya ya isi mbili mpaka kukangalwa na kukolwamlima kwa isi imonga. Walemba walola kila mfalumi na matendu gakuyi na Mlungu na yawamfata Mlungu ama yawamfatandiri Mlungu. Wafalumi wamu wamfata Mlungu ntambu yakafira 2 wafalumi 18: 3 wamonga watenda vidoda kwa Mlungu 2 Wafalumi 21: 2 panu walema katakulira weli kwa wafalumi walii yawamkanta Mlungu na yawamfata Mlungu ntambu yakawapanana mpatiru. Toziya waweliti wamjimira Mlungu nentu 2 wafalumi 17:7, tufunditi handa Israeli waweliti wawingwa.Toziya Waisraeli waweriti watenda vidoda kwa Mlungu na womberi waweliti waguwira wamlungu wamonga,</para>
  <para style="iot">YAGAWERAAMU</para>
  <para style="io">Shiyowelera kuusu upeleru wa ukolamlima wa Eliya wafunda na mhala Elisha. Shipandi 1-8:15</para>
  <para style="io">Tulifunditi wafalumi wa gweka wa Israeli na Yuda viraa kuwingwa kwa Waisraeli. Mushipandi 8:16-17</para>
  <para style="io">Shiyowelera kuleka ukolamlima kwa Hezekia, mfalumi gwa Yuda na ntambu yakamfatiti Mtuwa Mlungu. Shipandi 18-20</para>
  <para style="io">Shiyowelera makaliru ga upeleru ga mfalumi gwa Yuda na ntambu gaa Yuda ikangalitwi na kujegerwa kuuhamisiwu aku Babeli. Shipandi 21-25</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2KI 1" />
  <para style="s">Mbuyi Eliya na mfalumi Ahazia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 1:1" />Pakahowiti kala mfalumi Ahabu gwa Israeli, wantu wa Moabu wagalambukiti nawakolwamlima na Israeli.<verse eid="2KI 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 1:2" />“Mfalumi Ahazia pakaweriti Samalia kaguwiti kulawa kugolofa na kalitenda nentu. Hangu kawatuma walagilagi, kawagambira, mgendi kwa Baali Zebubu, mlungu gwa mji gwa Ekroni, mwakamkosiyi handa hamponi ulweri awu.” <verse eid="2KI 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 1:3" />Kumbiti malaika gwa Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira mbuyi gwa Mlungu Eliya kulawa Tishibe, kagendi kuliwona na walagilagi awa na kuwakosiya, “Ntambu gaa mwankugenda kwa Baali Zebubu, mlungu gwa Ekroni? Hashi, kwahera Mlungu muisi ya Israeli? <verse eid="2KI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 1:4" />Mmugambiri Mfalumi handa Mlungu kalonga hangu, gwenga hapeni guponi, nakaka haguhowi!” Su, Eliya kawagendera ntambu yakalagilitwi na Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2KI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 1:5" />Walagilagi walii wawuya kwa mfalumi. Na yomberi kawakosiya, “Hashi muwuya kalongola?”<verse eid="2KI 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 1:6" />Kawankula, “Tuliwona na muntu mweni katulagalira tuwuyi tukugambiri handa Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga hangu, ntambu gaa guwalagalira kwa Baali Zebubu, mlungu gwa Ekroni? Hashi, kwahera Mlungu muisi ya Israeli? Hapeni guponi, su nakaka haguhowi!”<verse eid="2KI 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 1:7" />Mfalumi kawakosiya, “Muntu gweni ndo gwa ntambu gaa yakaliwoniti na mwenga na kuwagambira vitwatira avi?”<verse eid="2KI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 1:8" />Womberi wamwankula, “Nayomberi kaweriti kavala nguwu ya mibahira na lufunga lwa lukuli mshunu.” Mfalumi kalonga, “Ayu ndo Eliya kalawa Tishibe!”<verse eid="2KI 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 1:9" />Shakapanu mfalumi kamlagalira mkulu gwa lishonta yumu na wamashonta wakuyi amusini wamjegi Eliya. Mkulu ayu kamwona Eliya kalivaga kulugongu, kamgambira, “Gwenga muntu gwa Mlungu, mfalumi kakugambira guseleri.”<verse eid="2KI 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 1:10" />Eliya kamwankula mkulu ayu na wantu wakuyi amusini, “Toziya neni ndo Muntu gwa Mlungu, motu gusuluki kulawa kumpindi kwa Mlungu na kukulunguziya tolosu gwenga pamuhera na wantu waku!” Katepu hera motu gusuluka kulawa kumpindi kwa Mlungu, gumlunguziya pamuhera na wantu wakuyi amusini.<verse eid="2KI 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 1:11" />Mfalumi kamlagalira mkulu yumonga na wantu wakuyi amusini wamjegi Eliya. Na yomberi kakwena pampindi kamgambira Eliya, “Gwee Muntu gwa Mlungu, mfalumi kakugambira gusuluki kalongola!”<verse eid="2KI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 1:12" />Eliya kamwankula, “Toziya neni ndo Muntu gwa Mlungu, motu na gusuluki kulawa kumpindi, gukulunguziyi gwenga pamuhera na wantu waku!” Palaapalii motu gwa Mlungu gusuluka kulawa kumpindi, gumlunguziya pamuhera na wantu wakuyi amusini.<verse eid="2KI 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 1:13" />Kwa mala yimonga kayi, mfalumi katuma mkulu yumonga na wantu wakuyi amusini. Mkulu gwa tatu kakwena kulugongu, kamsuntamalira Eliya na kumluwa pakalonga, “Gwee muntu gwa Mlungu, nikuluwa gumoneri lusungu neni na wantumintumi awa hamusini, nagutulaga! <verse eid="2KI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 1:14" />Wakulu wawili na wantu waku yawalongoleriti, walunguziwa na motu kulawa kumpindi kwa Mlungu, kumbiti vinu nikuluwa gugawoneri lusungu makaliru gangu.”<verse eid="2KI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 1:15" />Panu malaika gwa Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira Eliya, “Nagutira, gusuluki pamuhera na yomberi.” Su, Eliya kimuka kasuluka pamuhera na yomberi mpaka kwa mfalumi, <verse eid="2KI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 1:16" />kamgambira mfalumi, “Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga hangu. Hashi, ndo toziya kwahela Mlungu Muisraeli gwa kumkosiya mpaka guwalagaliriti walagilagi kumkosiya Baali Zebubu mlungu gwa Ekroni, toziya gutenda hangu hapeni gwimuki mushitanda shaku, nakaka haguhowi.”<verse eid="2KI 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 1:17" />Shakapanu Ahazia kahowa Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamgambiti kupitira mbuyi gwakuyi Eliya. Na toziya Ahazia kaweritindiri na mwana mpalu, Yoramu kaweriti mfalumi pahala pakuyi, mushinja sha pili sha ukolamlima wa Yehoramu mwana gwa Yehoshafati, mfalumi gwa Yuda.<verse eid="2KI 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 1:18" />Mirandu imonga yakatenditi mfalumi Ahazia, yoseri ilembitwi mushitabu sha historiya ya wafalumi wa Israeli.<verse eid="2KI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2KI 2" />
  <para style="s">Eliya kankutolwa kugenda kumpindi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 2:1" />su pashisokiti shaka sha Mtuwa Mlungu kumtola Eliya kugenda kumpindi muliyega lya shivyulavyula, Eliya na Elisha waweriti mnjira, pawalawa Giligali. <verse eid="2KI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 2:2" />Shakapanu pawaweriti mnjira, Eliya kamgambira Elisha, “Shondi gwenga gulikali panu, Mtuwa Mlungu kandagalira ng'endi Beteli.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:2">Kumbiti Elisha kamgambira, “Nilirapa nakaka hapeni nikuleki.” Su, wagenda pamuhera mpaka Beteli.<verse eid="2KI 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 2:3" />Lipinga lya wambuyi wa Mlungu yawaweriti aku wamgendera Elisha, wamkosiya, “Hashi, guvimana handa leru Mtuwa Mlungu hakamtoli mtuwa gwaku?” Elisha kankula,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:3">“Yina! Nivimana, mnyamali.”<verse eid="2KI 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 2:4" />Eliya kamgambira, “Shondi Elisha gulikali panu, Mtuwa Mlungu kandagalira ng'endi Yeriku.” Kumbiti Elisha kalema pakalonga, “Nilirapa nakaka hapeni nikuleki.” Su, wagenda pamuhera mpaka Yeriku.<verse eid="2KI 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 2:5" />Lipinga lya wambuyi wa Mlungu kulawa Yeriku wamgendera Elisha na kumkosiya, “Hashi, guvimana handa leru Mtuwa Mlungu kamtola mtuwa gwaku?” Elisha kawawankula,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:5">“Yina! Nivimana, mnyamali.”<verse eid="2KI 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 2:6" />Shakapanu Eliya kamgambira Elisha, “Shondi gwenga gulikali panu, Mtuwa Mlungu kandagalira ng'endi kulushemba lya Yoridani.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:6">Kumbiti Elisha kalonga, “Nilirapa nakaka hapeni nikuleki.” Su, wagenda pamuhera. <verse eid="2KI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 2:7" />Wambuyi wa Mlungu amusini wawafata mpaka kulushemba lwa Yoridani. Eliya na Elisha wagoloka pakwegera na lushemba na womberi wambuyi wa Mlungu wagoloka patali padidini. <verse eid="2KI 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 2:8" />Shakapanu Eliya kavula lihabiti lyakuyi, kayipinda na kugakoma mashi, mashi galibagulana pahala pawili na womberi waloka mpaka kumwambu, wapita pahala payuma. <verse eid="2KI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 2:9" />Pawasokiti kumwambu, Eliya kamgambira Elisha, “Gung'ambili shagufira nikutenderi pamberi nenewusiwi kwagwenga.” Elisha kamgambira, “Nduwa hali seemu mbili za uwezu waku wa kutenda mawuzawuza welinawu.”<verse eid="2KI 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 2:10" />Eliya kankula, “Luwa yaku ndo ikamala, ata hangu hagwanki likakala ali payiwera hagumoni shaka pambusiwa kwagwenga, kumbiti pagumonandiri, su hapeni gupananwi.”<verse eid="2KI 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 2:11" />Pawaweriti wankugendagenda na kuyowera, vumu mbutuka ya motu yayikwegitwi na farasi gwa motu viwatula gweka na yomberi, Eliya katolwa kumpindi mushivyulavyula shashizyengeta. <verse eid="2KI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 2:12" />Elisha pakashiwoniti shitwatira ashi kalira, “Tati gwangu, tati gwangu! Mlolera mkulu gwa Israeli guwuka!” Su, Elisha kamwonandiri kayi Eliya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:12">Ndo Elisha kanika lihabiti lyakuyi na kupapula vipandi viwili. <verse eid="2KI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 2:13" />Shakapanu kasoliti lihabiti lya Eliya yalimtulikiliti, kawuya na kagoloka pawunenemu wa lushemba Yoridani. <verse eid="2KI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 2:14" />Kagakoma mashi kwa lihabiti lya Eliya pakalonga, “Kakoshi Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Eliya?” Pakagakomiti mashi, galibagula pahala pawili na yomberi kaloka mpaka kumwambu. <verse eid="2KI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 2:15" />Lipinga lya wambuyi wa Mlungu kulawa Yeriku pawamwoniti, walonga, “Rohu ya Eliya ya kwa Elisha.” Su, wagenda kumwanka na kumsuntamalira. <verse eid="2KI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 2:16" />Wamgambira, “Twenga wantumintumi waku tuwera makambaku amusini, shondi gutuleki tugendi kumsakula mtuwa gwaku. Pamonga rohu ya Mtuwa Mlungu impapa na kumwasa pampindi pa lugongu tunga ama mlulalanda.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:16">Elisha kankula, “Ndala, namgenda.”<verse eid="2KI 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 2:17" />Kumbiti womberi wahimiziyiti mpaka Elisha kawonasoni, kawagambira “Mgendi.” Hangu wawatuma wantu hamusini wagenda wamsakula kila pahala kwa shaka sha mashaka matatu wamwonandiri. <verse eid="2KI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 2:18" />Shakapanu wawuya kwa Elisha yakaweriti kalikala aku Yeriku. Elisha kawakosiya, “Hashi, niwagambirandiri namgenda?”<verse eid="2KI 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mawuzawuza ga Elisha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 2:19" />Shakapanu wantu wamu wa Yeriku wamgendera Elisha, wamgambira, “Mtuwa, ntambu yaguluwona lushi alu ndo luherepa, kumbiti mashi gatuwerananga ndo madoda na gatenda zinda zikolopoki.”<verse eid="2KI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 2:20" />Elisha kawagambira, “Mlekeri munu mngati mubakuli yasyayi, shakapanu mnjegeri.” Na womberi wamjegera. <verse eid="2KI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 2:21" />Elisha kagenda kumbwiru za mashi, kasa munu agu mngati na kalonga, “Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga hangu. Nigatenda mashi aga gaherepi, kwanjira vinu hapenigajegi viwembu ama kukolopola zinda.” <verse eid="2KI 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 2:22" />Na mashi aga gaherepa mpaka leru, ntambu yakalongiti Elisha.<verse eid="2KI 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 2:23" />Elisha kawukiti Yeriku, kagenda Beteli. Pakaweriti mnjira, wantemba tunga walawa kumji wanja kumbolera pawalonga, “Ayo kana shipala!”<verse eid="2KI 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 2:24" />Elisha kagalambuka kawalola na kuwapangira kwa litawu lya Mtuwa Mlungu. Dubu wawili wa shidala walawa mushidowi, wawapapula wantemba alubayini na wawili muwamu mwawu.<verse eid="2KI 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 2:25" />Elisha kendereya na mwanja gwakuyi mpaka kulugongu lwa Karimeli na kulawa shakapanu kawuya Samalia.<verse eid="2KI 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2KI 3" />
  <para style="s">Nkondu pakati pa Israeli na Moabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 3:1" />Mushinja sha kumi na nani sha ukolamlima wa mfalumi Yehoshafati gwa Yuda, Yoramu mwana gwa Ahabu kanjiti kukolamlima Israeli, kakolitimlima kulawa Samalia kwa shaka sha vinja kumi na mbili. <verse eid="2KI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 3:2" />Yoramu katenditi makontola palongolu pa Mtuwa Mlungu, kumbiti yomberi kaweritindiri mdoda handa tati gwakuyi Ahabu na mawu gwakuyi Yezibeli, toziya kabomola nakamu shindwalingu sha Baali yashinyawitwi na tati gwakuyi. <verse eid="2KI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 3:3" />Ata hangu, Yoramu kalekandiri vidoda handa mfalumi Yeruboamu mwana gwa Nebati yakamlongoliriti, mweni ndo katenda vidoda na kuwatenda wantu wa Israeli watenda vidoda.<verse eid="2KI 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 3:4" />Mfalumi Mesha gwa Moabu kaweriti mfuga kondolu na kila shinja katozwa na mfalumi gwa Israeli, wanakondolu laki yimu na mibahira kulawa kondolu elufu yimu. <verse eid="2KI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 3:5" />Kumbiti Ahabu pakahowiti, mfalumi gwa Moabu kamgalambukiti mfalumi gwa Israeli. <verse eid="2KI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 3:6" />Hangu mfalumi Yoramu kawuka Samalia, kalijojonira lishonta lyoseri lya Israeli. <verse eid="2KI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 3:7" />Katuma ulagilagi kwa mfalumi Yehoshafati gwa Yuda, kamgambira, “Mfalumi gwa Moabu kangalambuka. Hashi, hagulikolani naneni tulikomangi na yomberi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 3:7">Mfalumi Yehoshafati kamwankula, “Nakala! Neni na gwenga ndo shintu shimu, wantu waneni ndo wa gwenga, farasi waneni ndo wa gwenga. <verse eid="2KI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 3:8" />Hashi, hatuwakomangi kulawa uwega woshi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 3:8">Yoramu kankula, “Tuwakomangi kulawa kushiwala sha Edomu.”<verse eid="2KI 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 3:9" />Su, mfalumi Yoramu kawuka pamuhera na mfalumi gwa Yuda na mfalumi gwa Edomu. Pa mwanja gwa mashaka saba, mashi gawapelera. Wawerandiri na mashi kwa mashonta wawu pota kwa wankanyama wawu. <verse eid="2KI 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 3:10" />Panu mfalumi gwa Israeli kalonga, “Su tupera! Mtuwa Mlungu katujojonira twawoseri wafalumi watatu katutuli mmawoku mwa mfalumi gwa Moabu.”<verse eid="2KI 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 3:11" />Mfalumi Yehoshafati kakosiya, “Hashi, kwahera mbuyi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu yoseri panu mweni tuweza kumkosiya shakutenda kwa Mtuwa Mlungu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 3:11">Ntumintumi yumu gwa mfalumi Yoramu gwa Israeli kankula, “Elisha mwana gwa Shafati kapanu. Yomberi kaweriti ntuminmtumi gwapakwegera gwa Eliya.”<verse eid="2KI 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 3:12" />Yehoshafati kalonga, “Ayu ndo mbuyi gwa Mlungu gwa nakaka.” Shakapanu wafalumi awa watatu wamgendera Elisha.<verse eid="2KI 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 3:13" />Elisha kamkosiya mfalumi gwa Israeli, “Hashi neni nikutangi gwenga? Gugendi gwakawaluwi shakutenda wambuyi wa Mlungu weni tati gwaku na mawu gwaku wawagendiriti.” Mfalumi gwa Israeli kankula,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 3:13">“Ndala!” Joramu kamwankula, “Mtuwa Mlungu ndo yakatushemiti twenga wafalumi watatu twizi su mfalumi gwa Moabu katubati.”<verse eid="2KI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 3:14" />Elisha kalonga, “Ntambu yakalikala Mtuwa Mlungu yakana likakala mweni neni nankumtendera, nilirapa handa meyiwerindiri kwa ligoya lyaweranali kwa ganja gwaku mfalumi Yehoshafati gwa Yuda, meniwapikinilindiri ata shididini. <verse eid="2KI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 3:15" />Kumbiti vinu mnjegeri mgomba shinanda,”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 3:15">Wamjega mgomba shinanda na pakaweriti kankugomba shinanda, likakala lya Mlungu limwizira Elisha, <verse eid="2KI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 3:16" />Kalonga, “Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga hangu, mubawi malindi kila pahala kululalanda. <verse eid="2KI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 3:17" />Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga tembera hapeni muwoni lyega pota mvula, lulalanda halumemi mashi na mwenga hamlandi, mwenga pamuhera na wang'ombi wenu na wakanyama wenu. <verse eid="2KI 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 3:18" />Kumbiti ashi ndo shitwatira shikamalandiri kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, yomberi hakawapananeni, viraa ukanka kuusu Moabu. <verse eid="2KI 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 3:19" />Hamgukanki kila mji mkulu na kila mji guherepa, hamyidumuli mitera yawu yoseri, hamdiwi mbwiru zoseri za mashi na kugahalibisiya malambu gawu goseri gana mota kwa kugamemiziya mabuwi.”<verse eid="2KI 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 3:20" />Shirawu yakuyi mandawira, shaka sha kulaviya malaviwu, vumu mashi ganyililika kulawa uwega wa Edomu na kwiza kila pahala kululalanda.<verse eid="2KI 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 3:21" />Wamowabu pawapatiti shisoweru handa wafalumi watatu awa wiza kuwakomanga womberi, wantu woseri yawaweza kulikomanga kwanjira wantemba mpaka wazewi, washemitwi, kila muntu kakola shintu sha kulikomangira na kutulwa mumpaka kala kwa nkondu. <verse eid="2KI 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 3:22" />Pawimukiti mandawira yakuyi, mshenji guweriti gumetameta pampindi pa mashi Wamoabu yawaweriti uwega wa pili, pawagaloliti gawoneka kuwera masheri handa mwazi. <verse eid="2KI 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 3:23" />Walonga, “Agu ndo mwazi! Nakaka wafalumi watatu awa walikomanga weni kwa weni na kulaguwa! Tugendeni twakatoli lopola!”<verse eid="2KI 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 3:24" />Kumbiti pawasokiti mulugonjeru lwa Israeli, wantu wa Israeli wawakomangiti na womberi watuga isi. Wantu wa Israeli wawafata mpaka Moabu agawu pawawalaga, <verse eid="2KI 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 3:25" />na kuyibomola miji yawu. Kila pawapititi palirambu liherepa, kila muntu kadankiliti libuwi mpaka kila lirambu limema mabuwi, ntambu iraayi wadiwa mbwiru zoseri za mashi na kudumula mitera yoseri iherepa. Shakapanu, gusigala mji mkulu gwa Kiri Hereseti gweka yakuyi, gweni viraa waguma luhemberu waguzyengeta na kugulopola.<verse eid="2KI 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 3:26" />Mfalumi gwa Moabu pakawoniti handa nkondu imgendela werindiri, kawatoliti wantu wakuyi miya saba wakulikomanga kwa magumba, kafiliti kupena mashonta ga wankondu wakuyi kupitira kwa mfalumi gwa Edomu, kumbiti kasinda. <verse eid="2KI 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 3:27" />Panu kamtola mwana gwakuyi gwa kwanja ndo mekaweri mfalumi pahala pakuyi, kamlaviya kaweri tambiku ya kulunguziwa pampindi pa shibambaza sha mji. Wantu wa Israeli pawawoniti aga, wakalaziwa nentu. Waguleka mji agu na kuwuya muisi yawu.<verse eid="2KI 3:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2KI 4" />
  <para style="s">Elisha kankumtanga mkenja mhushu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 4:1" />Su, mdala yumu muwawu mwa wadala wa wambuyi wa Mlungu wamgendera Elisha, kamgambira, “Ntumintumi gwaku, mpalu gwangu kahowa na ntambu yaguvimana, kaweriti kampanana nentu ligoya Mlungu, kumbiti yakaweriti kamwazimira senti kiza kuwatola wanawangu wawili waweri wamanda wakuyi.”<verse eid="2KI 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 4:2" />Elisha kamkosia, “Vinu nikutangi hashi? Gung'ambili shilii shaguwera nashi ukaya.” Mawu ayu mkenja kamwankula,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:2">“Neni ntumintumi gwaku nahera shintu shoseri ila supa ndidini ya lipaki.”<verse eid="2KI 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 4:3" />Elisha kamgambira, “Gugendi kwa wapakwegera waku kazimi vulu vyavyahera shintu vyagufira kupata. <verse eid="2KI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 4:4" />Shakapanu gugendi, gwenga pamuhera na wanawaku, mlitatiri mngati mnumba na mwanji kumemiziya lipaki muvulu azi. Kila vulu yamumemiziya, mshituli pampeku.”<verse eid="2KI 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 4:5" />Mkenja uli kagenda mnumba kulitatira mngati na wana wakuyi na kwanja kumintira lipaki muvulu. <verse eid="2KI 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 4:6" />Pavimemiti vintu vyoseri mkenja ulii kamgambira mwana gwakuyi yumu, “Gunjegeri vulu imonga.” Mwana gwakuyi kamwankula, “Vyoseri vimema!” Panu lipaki lileka kunyililika. <verse eid="2KI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 4:7" />Su mdala ayu kawuya kwa muntu gwa Mlungu na kumgambira shisoweru ashi. Na muntu gwa Mlungu kamgambira, “Gugendi gwakashuwuzi lipaki ali na kulipa uwanda waku, senti yayisigala mtenderi mwenga na wana waku.”<verse eid="2KI 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elisha na mawu mlunda kulawa Shunami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 4:8" />Lishaka limu Elisha kagenditi Shunami, kweni kalikaliti mawu yumu mlunda. Mawu ayu kamshemera Elisha kushiboga na kwanjira lishaka lilii kila shaka Elisha pakagendi Shunemu kagenditi kuliya shiboga kwa mawu ayu. <verse eid="2KI 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 4:9" />Mawu ayu kamgambira mpalu gwakuyi, “Nahera lyoga na muntu ayu yakasokaga kwa twenga kila mala ndo mnanagala gwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2KI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 4:10" />Su tumnyawili shumba shididini pagolofa pa numba yetu na aku tumtuliri shitanda na meza na shiti na lumuliku, su kashitenderi kila pakatutyangira.”<verse eid="2KI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 4:11" />Lishaka limu Elisha kiza aku na kakwena kushumba shilii su kwoyeri. <verse eid="2KI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 4:12" />Kamlagalira ntumintumi gwakuyi Gehazi, “Gumshemi mawu ayu Mshunami.” Pakamshemiti kiziti na kugoloka palongolu pa Gehazi. <verse eid="2KI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 4:13" />Na Elisha kamgambira Gehazi, “Gumgambiri, tuwona ntambu yagututendiriti, vinu kafira tumtenderi mlandu gaa? Hashi, mekafiri kaluwilwi shoseri kwa mfalumi ama kwa mkulu gwa lishonta?” Mawu Mshunami kamwankula,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:13">“Neni na wantu wangu twana kila shintu shatufira.”<verse eid="2KI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 4:14" />Elisha kalonga, “Su tumtenderi shishi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:14">Gehazi kamwankula, “Nakaka kahera mwana na mpalu gwakuyi mzewi.”<verse eid="2KI 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 4:15" />Elisha kamgambira, “Gumshemi kayi.” Na yomberi kamshema. Kiza na kagoloka paligomi. <verse eid="2KI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 4:16" />Elisha kamgambira, “shaka handa ashi shinja shashiza, haguweli na mwana mpalu.” Mawu ayu kamwankula,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:16">“Ndala, Mtuwa gwangu! Gwenga ndo muntu gwa Mlungu, nagumpayira neni ntumintumi gwaku!”<verse eid="2KI 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 4:17" />Kumbiti mdala ayu kapata yinda na kulera mwana shaka handa ashi shinja shashifatiti, ntambu yakamgambiriti Elisha.<verse eid="2KI 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 4:18" />Mwana ayu pakakuliti, kalawa lishaka limu pamuhera na tati gwakuyi, yakalilongoziyiti na wabenanga, <verse eid="2KI 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 4:19" />vumu mwana kamlilira tati gwakuyi, “Mtuwi guntama! Mtuwi guntama!” Tati gwakuyi kamgambira ntumintumi gwakuyi yumu,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:19">“Gumjegi kwa mawu gwakuyi.” <verse eid="2KI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 4:20" />Pakamsokiziyiti kwa mawu gwakuyi, kamkisira mwana gwakuyi mpaka paluwala, shakapanu kahowa. <verse eid="2KI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 4:21" />Mawu gwakuyi kamjega na kumgonjeka pashitanda sha muntu gwa Mlungu, kalitata ligomi na kuwuka. <verse eid="2KI 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 4:22" />Shakapanu kamshema mpalu gwakuyi na kumgambira, “Gumpanani ntumintumi yumu na punda yumu, su nimgenderi kalongola Elisha muntu gwa Mlungu, shakapanu hambuyi.”<verse eid="2KI 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 4:23" />Mpalu gwakuyi kamkosiya, “Ntambu gaa gufira kumwona leru? Leru ndo lishakandiri lya msambu gwa lyezi lya syayi pota lishaka lya kwoyera?” Mdala ulii kamwankula, “Nagulishera.” <verse eid="2KI 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 4:24" />Mdala ayu kamyalika punda na kumgambira ntumintumi ayu gumtugiziyi, “Vinu gukamaliri, nakupungula kutuga mpaka panikugambira.” <verse eid="2KI 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 4:25" />Su, kawuka, kagenda mpaka kulugongu lwa Karimeli pakaweriti Elisha muntu gwa Mlungu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:25">Muntu gwa Mlungu pakamwoniti kankwiza, kamgambira Gehazi ntumintumi gwakuyi, “Guloli, nimwona mdala uli Mshunami kankwiza, <verse eid="2KI 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 4:26" />Gutugi kalongola gukaliwoni na yomberi na kumgambira, gwakashina? Mpalu gwaku kakashina? Mwana kakashina?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:26">Na mdala kulawa Shunami kankula, “Twakashina.” <verse eid="2KI 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 4:27" />Pakasokiti kulugongu kwa Elisha muntu wa Mlungu kamkola magulu na yomberi Gehazi kasegelera su kamwusiyi, kumbiti muntu gwa Mlungu kamgambira, “Gumleki, toziya kana utama nentu na Mtuwa Mlungu kang'ambirandiri shitwatira ashi.”<verse eid="2KI 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 4:28" />Mawu ayu kamgambira, “Mtuwa gwangu, hashi, ndo nikuluwitindiri mwana? Neni nikugambiriti viraa nagumpayira?”<verse eid="2KI 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 4:29" />Elisha kamgabira Gehazi, “Gutoli luhonga lwa neni, guwuki ula vinu. Nagugoloka mnjira kumlamsiya muntu yoseri na muntu yoseri pakakulamsiya mnjira nagukawalira kuwuziya lamsiya. Gugendi longulongu mpaka ukaya na kutula luhonga lwa neni pampindi pa mwana.”<verse eid="2KI 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 4:30" />Mdala ayu kamgambira Elisha, “ Nilirapa nakaka hapeni nikuleki.” Su Elisha kawuka na kulilonguziya na yomberi. <verse eid="2KI 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 4:31" />Gehazi kalongolera kulongolu na pakasokiti katula luhonga lwa Elisha pampindi pa sheni sha mwana, kumbiti kuwonekanandiri langaliru lyoseri lya ukomu. Kawuya na kuliwona na Elisha, kamgambira, “Mntemba kimukandiri.”<verse eid="2KI 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 4:32" />Elisha pakasokiti, kingira gweka mushumba na kugawona mauti ga mntemba mshitanda. <verse eid="2KI 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 4:33" />Su, katata ligomi na kumluwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2KI 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 4:34" />Ndo kaligonjeka pampindi pa mwana, mlomu gwakuyi pampindi pa mlomu gwa mwana na masu gakuyi pampindi pa masu ga mwana na mawoku gakuyi pampindi pa mawoku ga mwana. Na pakaweriti kankutenda hangu, nshimba ya mwana yanja kupata livuki. <verse eid="2KI 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 4:35" />Elisha kagoloka na kugendagenda mushumba, shakapanu kawuya na kuligonjeka kayi panani pa mwana. Mwana katyamula mala saba, shakapanu katumula masu. <verse eid="2KI 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 4:36" />Elisha kamshema Gehazi na kumgambira, “Gumshemi mdala Mshunami ulii.” Pakashemitwi Elisha kamgambira, “Gumtoli mwana gwaku.” <verse eid="2KI 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 4:37" />Mdala ayu kasuntama palongolu pa Elisha agawu pakalonga mayagashiyi na kumtola mwana gwakuyi na kulawa kunja.<verse eid="2KI 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mauzauza gamonga mawili ga Elisha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2KI 4:38" />Elisha kawuya Giligali shaka muisi kuweriti na njala. Lishaka limu, pakaweriti kankufunda shipinga sha wambuyi wa Mlungu, kamgambira ntumintumi gwakuyi, “Gujereki shiwiga shikulu mumotu, guwatelekeri wambuyi wa Mlungu.” <verse eid="2KI 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2KI 4:39" />Yumu gwawu kagenda kulirambu kwapa likolu aku kawona mapukuyu ga muntundu kagapa na kugajega gavuwa ntambu yakaweziti kujega kagadumulanga na kugalekera mshiwiga pota kuvimana kuwera waliya ama waliyandiri. <verse eid="2KI 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="2KI 4:40" />Shiboga shipulwa. Kumbiti pawashilawaliriti wamlilira Elisha pawalonga, “Gwee muntu gwa Mlungu, shiboga ashi ashitulagi!” Na womberi wasinditi kushiliya. <verse eid="2KI 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="2KI 4:41" />Elisha kalagalira wamjegeri ubumu. Kajegelwa ubumu na yomberi kawutula mngati mu shiwiga na kulonga, “Vinu guwapanani shiboga walii.” Washiliya na wambukandiri.<verse eid="2KI 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2KI 4:42" />“Muntu yumu kulawa Baali Shalisha, kamjegera Elisha mabumunda kumi na mbili yaganyawitwi kwa shayiri yayiweriti ya kwanja kubena na mikunguwi miwisi ya nganu mlifafa. Elisha kamlagalira Gehazi kawapanani wantu waliyi.” <verse eid="2KI 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="2KI 4:43" />Ntumintumi gwakuyi kalonga, “hapeni niwapanani toziya shiwatoshandiri wantu miya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:43">Elisha kalonga, “Guwapanani waliyi, toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga handa pawaliya hawikuti na shimonga hashisigali.” <verse eid="2KI 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="2KI 4:44" />Ntumintumi gwakuyi kawatandira shiboga, waliya woseri wikuta na shimonga shisigala, Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakalongiti.<verse eid="2KI 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2KI 5" />
  <para style="s">Naamani kankuponiziwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 5:1" />Naamani mkulu gwa lishonta lya mfalumi gwa Aramu kaweriti muntu kamanika yakafiritwi nentu na mtuwa gwakuyi, toziya kwa njira yakuyi Mtuwa Mlungu kayijegeriti isi ya Aramu ukanka. Kaweriti lishonta mgangamala, kumbiti kaweriti na ugumbula. <verse eid="2KI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 5:2" />Munkondu yawaweriti wankulikomanga na Israeli, Waaramu waweriti wamtola mhinga yumu mdidini kulawa Israeli na yomberi kawera yaya gwa mdala gwa Naamani. <verse eid="2KI 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 5:3" />Lishaka limu kamgambira mdala gwa Naamani, “Kumbiti mtuwa gwangu mekagendi na kumwona yulii mbuyi gwa Mlungu yakawera Samalia! Mekamponiziyi ulweri wakuyi.” <verse eid="2KI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 5:4" />“Naamani pakapatiti visoweru avi, kagenda kwa mfalumi na kumgambira visoweru vya mwana ayu.” <verse eid="2KI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 5:5" />Mfalumi gwa Aramu kamgambira, “Hanimlembeli barua gumjegeri mfalumi gwa Israeli.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 5:5">Su Naamani kawuka, agawu pakatola vipandi elufi selasini vya madini ga feza, vipandi elufi sita vya zahabu na nguwu lirongu za msambu. <verse eid="2KI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 5:6" />Luhamba lwakalujegiti kwa mfalumi gwa Israeli, lulembitwi hangu, “Luhamba alu ndo lwa kummaniziya kwa gwenga mkulu gwaneni Naamani. Nfira gumponiziyi ulweli wakuyi awu.”<verse eid="2KI 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 5:7" />Mfalumi gwa Israeli pakasomiti kala barua alu kapapula nguwu yakuyi na kulonga, “Ntambu gaa mfalumi Aramu kafira numponiziyi muntu ayu ugumbula wakuyi? Kalihola neni ndo Mlungu yakawera na uwezu wa kulaga ama kuzyukusiya? Su muvimani, handa muntu ayu kafira kunjegera ndewu.”<verse eid="2KI 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 5:8" />Elisha, mbuyi gwa Mlungu, pakapatiti visoweru handa mfalumi gwa Israeli kapapulanga nguwu zakuyi, katumiti ulagilagi kwa mfalumi, kamkosiya, “Hashi gudeganga nguwu zaku? Gumjegi muntu ayu kwaneni, su kapati kuvimana handa kuna mbuyi gwa Mlungu Muisraeli!”<verse eid="2KI 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 5:9" />Naamani kagenda na farasi gwakuyi na mbutuka yakuyi yakukwega na nkanyama mpaka kuligomi lya Elisha. <verse eid="2KI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 5:10" />Elisha kamtuma ntumintumi gwakuyi kamgambiri, “Gugendi gukogi mala saba kulushemba Yoridani na gwenga haguweli mkomu nakamu.” <verse eid="2KI 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 5:11" />Kumbiti Naamu kakalala nentu, kagenda zakuyi pakalonga, “Niliholiti handa nakaka hakaniziri na kumluwa Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwakuyi na yomberi kapitiziyi mawoku gakuyi pahala palwala na kumponiziya! <verse eid="2KI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 5:12" />Nshemba Abana na Faripari ya aku Damasiku ndo iherepandiri kuliku mishemba yoseri ya Israeli? Hashi, mewezi ndiri koga amu na kupona?” Kawuka na kuwuya ukaya, agawu pakakalala nentu.<verse eid="2KI 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 5:13" />Wantumintumi wakuyi wamgendera na kumgambira, “Mtuwa gwetu handa mbuyi gwa Mlungu mekakugambiri gutendi shitwatira tunga shikamala, hashi, megushitendindiri? Vinu, ndo kakugambira alihera, guligululi, su guponi!” <verse eid="2KI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 5:14" />Su, Naamani kaselera kulushemba lya Yoridani kalidibiziya amu mala saba, ntambu yakalagaliritwi na Elisha mbuyi gwa Mlungu na yomberi kapona nakamu. Likuli lyakuyi liwera linama na liherepa handa ya mwana nonu. <verse eid="2KI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 5:15" />Su Naamani kawuya kwa mbuyi gwa Mlungu pamuhera na wantu wakuyi, pakalonga, “Vinu nivimana handa kwahera Mlungu yoseri ila hera Mlungu gwa Israeli, shondi gwanki lifupu lya neni ntumintumi gwaku Naamani.”<verse eid="2KI 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 5:16" />Elisha kankula, “Nilirapa nakaka hapeni nanki lifupu lyolyoti.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 5:16">Naamani kamluwa, kumbiti Elisha kalema nakamu. <verse eid="2KI 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 5:17" />Naamani kalonga, “Payiwera gwanki mafupu ganeni, su shondi gumpanani ntumintumi gwaku litapaka lyaliweza kupapwa na punda wawili, toziya kwanjira leru neni <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:17 </char></note>ntumintumi gwaku hapeni ndaviyi tambiku ya kulunguziwa pota tambiku za wamlungu wamonga ilahera kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2KI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 5:18" />Hangu nduwa Mtuwa Mlungu kandekiziyi panalikolerana na mfalumi gwaneni kugenda kumguwira mu Hekalu ya Rimoni mlungu gwa Aramu. Nduwa Mlungu kandekiziyi!”<verse eid="2KI 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 5:19" />Elisha kamgambira, “Gugendi kwa ponga.” Naamani kagenda zakuyi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 5:19">Pakaweriti kankali kugenda kutali, <verse eid="2KI 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 5:20" />Gehazi, ntumintumi gwa Elisha mbuyi gwa Mlungu, kalitakuziya mumoyu, “Mtuwa gwangu kamlekeziya hera hangu Naamani Mwaramu kagendi pota kwanka shoseri shakajegiti. Nakaka hanimfati su kampanani shintu kulawa kwakuyi.” <verse eid="2KI 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 5:21" />Su kawuka kumfata Naamani. Naamani pakamoniti muntu kankumfata, kasuluka mumbutuka mwakuyi kagenda kuliwona na yomberi. Su, kamkosiya, “Hashi, kwana ponga?”<verse eid="2KI 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 5:22" />Gehazi kankula, “Vitwatira vyoseri ndo teratera ilahera mtuwa gwaneni kandagalira nikugambiri handa vinu kampanana wantu wawili wa shipinga sha wambuyi wa Mlungu muisi ya Efraimu yanamigongu na yomberi mekefiri guwapanani vipandi elufi tatu vya feza na nguwu doti mbili za msambu.”<verse eid="2KI 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 5:23" />Naamani kalonga, “Shondi gutoli vipandi elufi sita vya madini ga feza.” Kamluwa Gehazi, shakapanu kamtawira mafungu mawili na kumpanana nguwu doti mbili za msambu, kawapanana wantumintumi wakuyi wawili muwamu mwa wantumintumi wawlii na kuwalagalira walilonguziyi na Gehazi. <verse eid="2KI 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 5:24" />Pawasokiti kulugongu pakalikaliti Elisha, Gehazi katola vintu kulawa kwa wantumintumi wa Naamani na kuvijega mngati, ukaya kwakuyi. Shakapanu kawalekiziya walii wantumintumi wagendi zawu na womberi wawuka.<verse eid="2KI 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 5:25" />Shakapanu Gehazi kingira ukaya kwa Elisha na kwanja kumtendera. Elisha kamkosiya,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 5:25">“Gugenditi koshi?” Gehazi kankula, “Ng'endandiri pahala poseri.”<verse eid="2KI 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 5:26" />Kumbiti Elisha kamgambira, “Hashi rohu yaneni iwerandiri pamuhera na gwenga shaka muntu yulii pakalawiti mumbutuka mwakuyi na kwiza kuliwona na gwenga? Hashi, ashi ndo shaka sha kwanka mpiya na nguwu, malambu ga mizyetuni na mizabibu, kondolu na ng'ombi ama wantumintumi wa shipalu na wa shidala? <verse eid="2KI 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 5:27" />Hangu ugumbula wa Naamani hawukukoli gwenga, na wiwuka waku mashaka goseri!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 5:27">Su, Gehazi kawukiti pakawera na ugumbula na likuli lyakuyi liweriti neru mbuwu.<verse eid="2KI 5:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2KI 6" />
  <para style="s">Liwagu liwoneka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 6:1" />Lishaka limu, shipinga sha wambuyi wa Mlungu wamlalamikiriti Elisha pawalonga, “Pahala panu patulikala ndo padidini nentu kwatwenga! <verse eid="2KI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 6:2" />Gutujimili tugendi Yoridani tuyidumuli mitera su tulinyawili pahala pakututosha.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 6:2">Elisha kawankula, “Mgendi.”<verse eid="2KI 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 6:3" />“Yumu gwawu kamluwa pakalonga, shondi gugendi na twenga wantumintumi waku. Na yomberi kankula, hang'endi,” <verse eid="2KI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 6:4" />hangu kagenda pamuhera na womberi na pawasokiti kulushemba Yoridani wanja kudumula mitera. <verse eid="2KI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 6:5" />Yumu gwawu pakaweriti kankudumula mitera, liwagu lwakuyi lisomoka na kutulukira mumashi, kalira, pakalonga, “Vinu mtuwa gwangu hantendi hashi?” “Liwagu ali twazika kwa muntu!”<verse eid="2KI 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 6:6" />Elisha kankosiya, “Litulukira koshi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 6:6">Muntu ayu kamlanguziya, Elisha kadumula lubiki na kwasa mumashi na palaa palii liwagu liyeruka mumashi. <verse eid="2KI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 6:7" />“Elisha kamgambira kalitoli. Yomberi kalitalipisiya liwoku, kalitola.”<verse eid="2KI 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lishonta lya Waaramu lisinda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 6:8" />“Shaka shimu kuweriti na nkondu pakati pa Aramu na Israeli. Su, mfalumi gwa Aramu waligambiziyana na wakulu wa mashonta kuusu pahala pakutula malingu gawu.” <verse eid="2KI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 6:9" />“Kumbiti Elisha kamjegera shisoweru mfalumi wa Israeli kalikali weri na pahala panu, toziya Waaramu waweriti kala kupakomanga.” <verse eid="2KI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 6:10" />Su, mfalumi gwa Israeli kawalagalira mashonta wakuyi pakwegera na pahala pakagambiritwi. Elisha kendiriyiti kumberiziya mfalumi na mfalumi kaweriti kalilolera weri. Shitwatira ashi shitendikiti mala zivuwa.<verse eid="2KI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 6:11" />Mfalumi gwa Aramu ashi shimkalaziya nentu, kawashema wakulu wakuyi, kawakosiya, “Mng'ambiri gaa pakati pamwenga gaa yakagenda kulaviya visoweru kwa mfalumi wa Israeli?”<verse eid="2KI 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 6:12" />Yumu gwawu kankula, “Mfalumi kwahera yakatugalambuka. Ayu ndo Elisha, mbuyi gwa Mlungu yakawera aku Israeli. Yomberi kamgambiraga mfalumi gwa Israeli shoseri shagulonga ata paguwera mushumba shaku sha kugonja.”<verse eid="2KI 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 6:13" />Mfalumi kawagambira, “Mgendi mkamloliloli muvimani pahala pakawera naneni haniwatumi wantu wambati.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 6:13">Su, pawamgambiriti handa Elisha kaweriti aku Dotani, <verse eid="2KI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 6:14" />mfalumi kalagalira lishonta likulu pamuhera na farasi na mbutuka za kukwega. Lishonta ali lisoka aku pashiru na kuguzyengeta mji. <verse eid="2KI 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 6:15" />Shirawu yakuyi mandawira putiputi ntumintumi gwa Elisha pakimukiti na kulawa kunja, kawona lishonta pamuhera na farasi na mbutuka za kukwegwa ziguzyengeta mji. Kawuya mnumba na kalonga, “Shodi twenga, gwee, Mtuwa gwangu! Vinu hatutendi hashi?”<verse eid="2KI 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 6:16" />Elisha kankula, “Nagutira toziya yawawera pamuhera na twenga ndo wavuwa kuliku yawawera pamuhera na womberi.” <verse eid="2KI 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 6:17" />Shakapanu Elisha kaluwa, “Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, gumgubutuli masu su kapati kuwona!” Su, Mtuwa Mlungu kagavugula masu ga mntemba ayu, kawona farasi na mbutuka za motu ziwera kila pahala mulugongu loseri, kumzyengeta Elisha.<verse eid="2KI 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 6:18" />Waaramu pawakomangiti, Elisha kamluwiti Mtuwa Mlungu pakalonga, “Nikuluwa guwatendi wantu awa waweri na lwisi!” Mtuwa Mlungu kapikanira luwa yakuyi na kuwatenda waweri na lwisi. <verse eid="2KI 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 6:19" />Elisha ndo kawagendera na kuwagambira, “Mwagamira agu ndo mjindiri yamgusakula mnfati naneni haniwajegi kwa yulii yamumsakula.” Na yomberi kawalongoziya mpaka Samalia.<verse eid="2KI 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 6:20" />Katepu pawingiriti kumji, Elisha kaluwa, pakalonga, “Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, guwagubutuli masu su waloli.” Mtuwa Mlungu kapikanira luwa yakuyi, kawagubutula masu. Na womberi waliwona wa pakati pa mji gwa Samalia.<verse eid="2KI 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 6:21" />Mfalumi gwa Israeli pakawawoniti Waaramu, kamkosiya Elisha, “Mtuwa hashi, niwalagi?”<verse eid="2KI 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 6:22" />Elisha kankula, “Ndala, naguwalaga, toziya gwenga guwabatitindiri kwa ligumba lyaku. Guwapanani shiboga na mashi waliyi na kulanda shakapanu guwaleki wawuyi kwa mtuwa gwawu.” <verse eid="2KI 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 6:23" />Mfalumi gwa Israeli kawatendera msambu mkulu, pawamaliriti kuliya na kulanda, kawawuziya kwa mtuwa gwawu. Kulawa shaka ashi, Waaramu wayikomitikayindiri isi ya Israeli kwa shaka shitangala.<verse eid="2KI 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mji gwa Samalia gwankuzyengetwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 6:24" />Shakapanu, mfalumi Beni Hadadi gwa Aramu kajojonira lishonta lyakuyi lyoseri kalawa na kuguzyengeta mji gwa Samaliya. <verse eid="2KI 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 6:25" />Shitwatira ashi shijegiti njala nkulu kumji gwa Samalia. Mtuwi gwa punda shishuuzwa kwa beyi vipandi selasini vya feza na gramu miya mbili za mapimba ga ng'unda gashuuzitwi vipandi vya mhanu vya feza.<verse eid="2KI 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 6:26" />Lishaka limu mfalumi gwa Israeli pakaweriti kankutyanga pampandi pa shibambasa sha mji, kapikanira mdala yumu pakamshema, “Guntangi, gwee mtuwa gwangu mfalumi!”<verse eid="2KI 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 6:27" />Mfalumi kamgambira, “Mtuwa Mlungu pakakutangandiri neni hawezihashi kukutanga? Hashi nana shiboga ama divayi yakukupanana gwenga? <verse eid="2KI 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 6:28" />Ntabiku yaku ndo shishi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 6:28">Kamwankula, “Mashana mdala ayu kang'ambiriti tumliyi mwana gwangu na Shirawu yakuyi tumliyi mwana gwakuyi. <verse eid="2KI 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 6:29" />Tumtereka mwana gwangu, tumliya. Shirawu yakuyi nimgambira tumliyi mwana gwakuyi, kumbiti kaweriti kamfifa!”<verse eid="2KI 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 6:30" />Katepu mfalumi pakapikaniriti visoweru vya mdala ayu kapapuliti nguwu zakuyi kwa hinginika na wantu yawaweriti pakwegera na shibambaza wawoniti handa kaweriti kavala nguwu ya liguniya mngati mwakuyi. <verse eid="2KI 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 6:31" />Na yomberi kalonga, “Mlungu kandagi, Handa Elisha mwana gwa Shafati pakadumuluwandiri mtuyi leru!” <verse eid="2KI 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 6:32" />Ndo kamtuma mlagilagi kugenda kumjega Elisha.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 6:32">Shaka ashi Elisha kaweriti ukaya pamuhera na wazewi yawamtyangiriti. Pamberi pa mlagilagi gwa mfalumi kusoka, Elisha kawagambira wazewi, “Mlaga ulii kamtuma muntu kizi kundumula mtuyi! Pakasoka panu, mtati ligomi, nammuleka kingiri. Viraa mtuwa gwakuyi kankumfata kumbeli.” <verse eid="2KI 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 6:33" />Pamberi ata hakenimaliri kutakula, mfalumi kasoka, nakulonga, “Mirandu ayi idoda ilawa kwa Mtuwa Mlungu! Ntambu gaa nendereyi kumuhepera Mtuwa kantangi?”<verse eid="2KI 6:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2KI 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 7:1" />Elisha kamwankula, “Gupikaniri shisoweru sha Mtuwa Mlungu, shirawu shaka handa ashi, muligomi lya Samalia kilu ntatu za ubumu uherepa hauweri ligwala shekeli yimu ya mpiya na kilo sita za shayili ntambu iraa haziweli feza shekeli yimu.”<verse eid="2KI 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 7:2" />Mkulu gwa mashonta yakatumbirwa na mfalumi kamgambira Elisha, “Handa Mtuwa Mlungu mweni mekatendi madilisha kumpindi, hashi, mlandu agu haguwezikani!” Elisha kamwankula,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 7:2">“Haguwoni kwa masu gaku gamweni, kumbiti gwenga haguliyindiri.”<verse eid="2KI 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lishonta lya Aramu liwuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 7:3" />Kuweriti na wantu wamsheshi wana ungumbula yawaweriti kunja kuligomi lya mji gwa Samalia weni walitakuziya, wenigweka, “Hatulikali panu mpakandii, patuhowa njala? <verse eid="2KI 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 7:4" />Kwahera mana ya kwingira kumji toziya aku hatuhowi. Hangu su tugendi kulugonjeru lwa Waaramu, pamonga hawatulagi ama kutuleka.” <verse eid="2KI 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 7:5" />Hangu, luwindu palwanjiti kwingira, wagenda kulugonjeru lya Waaramu, pawasokiti aku, kumbi paweritindiri na muntu. <verse eid="2KI 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 7:6" />“Toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kalitenditi lishonta lya Waaramu lipikaniri liziwu handa lya lishonta likulu lyaliweriti na mbutuka na farasi. Waaramu walisheriti kuwera mfalumi gwa Israeli kawashema na kuwalipa mashonta ga Wahiti na Wamisri kwiza kuwakomanga.” <verse eid="2KI 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 7:7" />Su, pashiru panu, Waaramu watugiti woseri su kugalopola makaliru gawu pawaleka malingu gawu, farasi na punda wawu na ata ng'onjeru zawu ntambu yaziweriti.<verse eid="2KI 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 7:8" />Wangumbula walii wamsheshi pawasokiti pambwega pa ngonjeru, wingiriti mngati mwa liringu limu, waliya na kulanda vintu vyawavipatiti amu, watola mpiya, zahabu na nguwu, wagenda kufifa. Wingira muliringu limonga na kutenda ntambu iraayi. <verse eid="2KI 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 7:9" />Kumbiti waligambirana, “Shatutenda ndo teraterandiri! Ashi ndo shisoweru shiwagira shatuweriti nashi leru na payiwera hatuweli mpaka mandawira, shondi hatukomangwi. Tugendeni kalongola twakawagambiri wantu wa numba ya mfalumi!” <verse eid="2KI 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 7:10" />Hangu, wawuka mulugonjeru lya Waaramu na kuwashema walolera ligomi lya mji na kuwagambira. “Tugenditi mulugonjeru lwa Waaramu na tuwezitindiri kuwawona muntu pota kumpikanira yoseri. Farasi na punda wankali wankutawalilwa na malingu ga ntambu yawalekiti.”<verse eid="2KI 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 7:11" />Walolera migomi wavibwera visoweru avi mpaka visoka ukaya kwa mfalumi. <verse eid="2KI 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 7:12" />Tembera Iweriti kwankali luwindu, mfalumi kimuka na kuwagambira walonguziya wakuyi, “Neni nivimana mgomiziwu gwa Waaramu! Wavimana twana njala kumji, vinu waleka ng'onjeru zawu wagenda kulififa su patugenda kusakula shiboga, watubati twawoseri wakomu na kugulopola mji.”<verse eid="2KI 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 7:13" />Yumu pakati pa walonguziya wakuyi kalonga, “Wantu wavuwa watenduwa handa walii yawahowiti kala. Shondi guwalagaliri wantu wadidini na farasi mhanu wa walii yawasigaliti su wagendi kulola shilawira shishi.” <verse eid="2KI 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 7:14" />Wasyagula wantu na kuwapanana mbutuka mbili. Mfalumi kawalagalira wagendi kulola shashiwalawiriti Waaramu pakalonga, “Mgendi mwakaloli.” <verse eid="2KI 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 7:15" />Wantu wawafatiti mpaka Yoridani na mnjira wayiwona nguwu na vintu vimonga Waaramu vyawavilekiti pawaweriti wankutuga. Wawuya na kumgambira mfalumi visoweru avi. <verse eid="2KI 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 7:16" />Wantu wa Samaliya walawa na kutola lopola kung'onjeru ya Waaramu, Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakalongiti. Kilu mhanu za ubumu uherepa wa nganu ama kilu lirongu za shayili ishuuzitwi kwa shipandi shimu sha feza.<verse eid="2KI 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 7:17" />Na mfalumi kaweriti kamtula mkulu gwa mlolera, kulolera ligomi lya mji. Mkulu ayu katimbagwa palaapalii kuligomi na kulaguwa na wantu, ntambu yakatakuliti Elisha mbuyi gwa Mlungu,mfalumi pakagenditi kumlola. <verse eid="2KI 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 7:18" />Elisha kaweriti kamgambira mfalumi shaka handa ashi lishaka lyalifatiti, vibaba mhanu vya ubumu uherepa wa nganu ama kilu lirongu lya shayiri melishuuzwi kwa shipandi shimu sha mpiya kuligomi lya mji, palii kwanja <verse eid="2KI 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 7:19" />mkulu gwa mashonta kaweriti kambelera Elisha, pakalonga, “Shitwatira ashi hapeni shilawiri ata handa Mtuwa Mlungu mweni mekatendi madilisha kumpindi” Elisha kaweriti kamwankula, “Haguwoni yagatendeka, kumbiti shiboga sheni hapeni gushiliyi.” <verse eid="2KI 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 7:20" />Hangu ndo ntambu yayilawiriti, mkulu gwa lishonta kahowa kwa kutimbagwa na wantu ligomi ali lya mji.<verse eid="2KI 7:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2KI 8" />
  <para style="s">Mdala kulawa Shunemu kankuwuya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 8:1" />Elisha kaweriti kamgambira mdala yakalikaliti Shunemu yakaweriti kamzyukusiya mwana gwakuyi, “Guwuki na mlongu gwaku, guhamili kushihenga toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kajega njala yayiwerimlamu muisi kwa shipindi sha vinja saba.” Kamgambira kahami kagendi pahala pamonga. <verse eid="2KI 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 8:2" />Mdala ayu kawuka katenda handa mbuyi gwa Mlungu ntambu yakalongiti kagenda pamuhera na mlongu gwakuyi na kulikala handa mhenga muisi ya Filisiti kwa mivinja saba.<verse eid="2KI 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 8:3" />Vinja saba paviperiti, kawukiti Filisiti kawuya Israeli na kugenda kwa mfalumi kuluwa kawuzililwi numba yakuyi na lirambu lyakuyi. <verse eid="2KI 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 8:4" />Kamwoniti mfalumi kankuyowera na Gehazi, pakalonga, “Shondi gung'ambili mauzauza gagatendwa na Elisha.” <verse eid="2KI 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 8:5" />Shaka Gehazi pakaweriti kankumgambira mfalumi, Elisha ntambu yakamzyukisiyiti muntu yakahowiti, su mdala ayu kiziti kumluwa mfalumi. Gehazi kalonga, “Gwee mfalumi, mdala mweni ndo ayu, Elisha kamzyukusiyiti mwana gwakuyi!” <verse eid="2KI 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 8:6" />“Mfalumi pakamkosiyiti mdala ayu nayomberi kamgambiriti, shakapanu mfalumi kamshema mlonguziya gwa wantumintumi wakuyi na kumgambira kamwuziliri mdala ayu ulunda wakuyi woseri, pamuhera na mota yoseri ya malambu gakuyi mushipindi ashi shoseri sha vinja saba.”<verse eid="2KI 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elisha na mfalumi Beni Hadadi gwa Aramu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 8:7" />“Lishaka limu Elisha kagenditi Damasiko. Shaka ashi mfalumi Beni Hadadi kaweriti mlweri na pakagambiritwi handa Elisha kaweriti Damasiko,” <verse eid="2KI 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 8:8" />kamgambira mlonguziya gwa wantumintumi wakuyi Hazaeli, “Gumjegeri mbuyi gwa Mlungu lifupu gumgambiri kamkosiyi Mtuwa Mlungu handa hamponi ama ahowi.” <verse eid="2KI 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 8:9" />Hazaeli kajega mafupu ga kila ntambu ga vintu vyoseri viherepa vya Damasiko pamuhera na visanka vyavipapitwi na ngamiya arobaini na kumjegera Elisha. Pakasokiti kwa Elisha kamgambira, “Ntumintumii gwaku, Beni Hadadi, mfalumi wa Aramu kantuma kwaku, yomberi kakosiya, hamboni ulweri awu?”<verse eid="2KI 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 8:10" />Su, Elisha kamwankula, gugendi gukamgambiri “Nakaka hakaponi, kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu kananguziya handa hakahowi.” <verse eid="2KI 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 8:11" />Ndo Elisha kamloladii pakawera na lyoga ata Hazaeli kawona lyoga. Vumu, Elisha mbuyi gwa Mlungu, kanja kulira. <verse eid="2KI 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 8:12" />Hazaeli kamkosiya, “Mtuwa gwangu, hashi gwankulira?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 8:12">Elisha kamwankula, “Toziya nivimana madoda geni haguwatenderi wantu wa Israeli. Hagulunguziyi maboma gawu kwa motu, na kuwalaga wantemba wawu kwa ligumba, haguwapontangi na kuwapapula wadala wana zinda.”<verse eid="2KI 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 8:13" />Hazaeli kakosiya, “Kumbiti neni ntumintumi gwaku nahera shoseri shaweza hawezi hashi kutenda mirandu mikulu?” Elisha kankula, “Mlungu kananguziya handa haguweri mfalumi gwa Aramu.”<verse eid="2KI 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 8:14" />Elizaeli ndo kawukiti kwa Elisha, kawuya kwa mkulu gwakuyi. Mfalumi Beni Hadadi kamkosiya, “Elisha kakugambiriti shishi?” Hazaeli kamwankula, “Kang'ambiriti nakaka haguponi.” <verse eid="2KI 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 8:15" />Kumbiti shirawu yakuyi Hazaeli katola libulangeti kalilekera mumashi, shakapanu kamgubikira nalu kusheni mpaka kahowa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 8:15">Hazaeli kakolamlima pahala pakuyi.<verse eid="2KI 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Yehoramu gwa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 21:1-20">2 Mirandu 21:1-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 8:16" />Mushinja sha mhanu sha ukolamlima wa Yoramu mwana gwa Ahabu, mfalumi gwa Israeli, Yehoramu mwana gwa Yehoshafati, mfalumi gwa Yuda kanjiti kukolamlima. <verse eid="2KI 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 8:17" />Pakanjiti kukolamlima kaweriti na vinja selasini na viwili. Kakolitimlima aku Yerusalemu vinja vinani, <verse eid="2KI 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 8:18" />Mdala gwakuyi kaweriti mhinga gwa Ahabu. Yolamu kafatiti njira zidoda za wafalumi wamonga wa Israeli handa kaya ya Ahazi na katenda makontola kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2KI 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 8:19" />Kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu kafirandiri kuwagamiziya wantu wa Yuda, toziya ya Dawudi ntumintumi gwakuyi, ntambu katakuliti handa walelwa wakuyi hawendereyi kukolamlima mashaka goseri.<verse eid="2KI 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 8:20" />Shaka sha ufalumi wa Yehoramu, wantu wa Edomu walemiti ukolamlima wa Yuda, wamlumika mfalumi gwawu. <verse eid="2KI 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 8:21" />Hangu Yehoramu kawukiti na mbutuka zakuyi zoseri zakukwega na farasi kagenda Zairi kweni Waedomu waweriti wawazyengeta. Shaka sha pashiru kalawiti na wakulu wa mashonta wakuyi wa mbutuka kawakomanga Waedomu, kumbiti watoloka na lishonta lyakuyi litugiti na kuwuya ukaya. <verse eid="2KI 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 8:22" />Hangu wantu wa Edomu walemiti kukolwamlima na Yuda mpaka vinu. Shaka shiraashi, wenikaya wa Libina na weni walemiti.<verse eid="2KI 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 8:23" />
    <note caller="+" style="fe">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">8:23 </char>
    </note>Kila shintu shakatediti mfalumi Yehoramu shilembwa mu Shitabu sha Maholu ga Wafalumi wa Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 8:24" />Yehoramu kahowa na kufintirwa mumalisembi ga shifalumi mumji gwa Dawudi na yomberi Ahazia, mwana gwakuyi Yehoramu, kakolamlima pahala pakuyi.<verse eid="2KI 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Ahazia gwa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 22:1-6">2 Mirandu 22:1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 8:25" />Mshinja sha lirongu na mbili sha ukolamlima wa Yoramu mwana gwa Ahabu mfalumi gwa Israeli, Ahazia mwana gwa Yehoramu mfalumi gwa Yuda, kanjiti kukolamlima. <verse eid="2KI 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 8:26" />Ahazia kanjiti kukolamlima pakawera na vinja ishilini na mbili, kakolamlima kulawa Yerusalemu kwa shaka sha shinja shimu. Mawu gwakuyi wamshemiti Atalia, mzyukulu gwa mfalumi Omri yakaweriti mfalumi gwa Israeli. <verse eid="2KI 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 8:27" />Toziya Ahazia kaweriti nahonga gwa mlongu gwa Ahabu na yomberi kafatiti njira ya kaya ayi ya Ahabu, katenditi makontola palongolu pa Mtuwa Mlungu, handa kaya ya Ahabu ntambu yawatenditi.<verse eid="2KI 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 8:28" />Mfalumi Ahazia kagenda na Yoramu mwana gwa Ahabu kulikomanga na Hazaeli mfalumi gwa Aramu aku Ramoti Gileadi pahala Waaramu pawamtenditi Yoramu. <verse eid="2KI 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 8:29" />Shakapanu mfalumi Yoramu kawuya kumji gwa Yezireeli su kapati kuponiziwa vironda vyakuyi vyakapatiti aku Rama, pakalikomangiti na Hazaeli mfalumi gwa Aramu. Nayomberi Ahazia mwana gwa Yehoramu mfalumi gwa Yuda kamgenderiti Yoramu mwana gwa Ahabu aku Yezreeli, toziya kaweriti mlweri.<verse eid="2KI 8:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2KI 9" />
  <para style="s">Yehu kalumikwa kuwera mfalumi gwa Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 9:1" />Shaka shiraashi mbuyi gwa Mlungu Elisha kamshemiti yumu gwa wafunda wa wambuyi, kamgambira, “Gulitandi kugenda Ramoti Gileyadi. Gutoli supa ayi ya lipaki, <verse eid="2KI 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 9:2" />pagusoka aku, gumsakuli Yehu mwana gwa Yehoshofati na mzukulu gwa Nimshi. Gumtoli mushumba kati su nakawera na wayaguyi, <verse eid="2KI 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 9:3" />shakapanu gutoli supa ayi ya lipaki, gumwitiliri kumtuyi na kumgambira, Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga hangu. Nikusyaga lipaki kuwera mfalumi gwa Israeli. Shakapanu guvuguli ligomi na kuwuka kalongola.”<verse eid="2KI 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 9:4" />Su, Mbuyi gwa Mlungu ayu mntemba kagenda Ramoti Gileyadi, <verse eid="2KI 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 9:5" />pakasokiti kawawonita wakulu wa lishonta mkuliwona. Kalonga, “Mkulu gwa lishonta nana ulagilagi waku.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:5">Yehu kamkosiya, Ndo gaa pakati petu yagumgambira? Kankula,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:5">“Gwenga, mkulu gwa lishonta.” <verse eid="2KI 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 9:6" />Woseri wawili ndo wingira mushumba kati na aku mbuyi gwa Mlungu kamumiminira Yehu lipaki kumtuwi na kumgambira, “Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli, kalonga, nikumiminira lipaki guweri mfalumi pampindi pa wantu waneni wa Israeli. <verse eid="2KI 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 9:7" />Na gwenga haguwalagi kaya ya mtuwa gwaku Ahabu su nimwuziliri Yezebeli kwa kuwalaga wantumintumi waneni wambuyi na wantumintumi waneni wamonga. <verse eid="2KI 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 9:8" />Hagutendi hangu toziya kaya yoseri ya Ahabu ilaguwa, viraa haniwalagi kila mpalu gwa walongu wa Ahabu kaweri mmanda ama muntu lekeru. <verse eid="2KI 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 9:9" />Haniwatendeli kaya yakuyi handa kaya ya Yeruboamu mwana gwa Nebeti na kaya ya Baasha mwana gwa Ahiya. <verse eid="2KI 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 9:10" />Kwahela muntu yakamfindila Yezebeli, mawuti gakuyi hagaliyiwi na wang'ang'a muisi ya Yezireeli.” Pa kamaliliti kulonga hangu, mbuyi gwa Mlungu kawuka mushumbakati na kutuga.<verse eid="2KI 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 9:11" />Yehu pakawuyiti kwa wayaguwi, yumu gwawu kamkosiya, “Kwana shitwatira shoseri?” Muntu ayu kana lukwali ayu kafira shishi kwagwenga?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:11">Yehu kawankula, “Shakalongiti shahela mana.”<verse eid="2KI 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 9:12" />Na womberi wamgambira, “Ayi ndo nakaka ndiri! Gutugambiri shakalongiti!” Yehu Kawagambira,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:12">“Kang'ambiriti handa Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga, nikulumika guweri mfalumi gwa Israeli.”<verse eid="2KI 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 9:13" />Palaa panu wakulu wa mashonta wayaguyi wavula mahabiti gawu, wayalika pamuhera kulukweneru su kagoloki pampindi pakuyi, wagomba magoli na kubotanga, “Yehu ndo mfalumi”<verse eid="2KI 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Yoramu gwa Israeli kankulaguwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 9:14" />Yehu mwana gwa Yehoshofati, mweni viraa kaweriti mzukulu gwa Nimishi, kamgalambuka Yoramu. Yoramu na wantu woseri wa Israeli waweriti Ramoti Gileyadi kumdiwira mfalumi Hazaeli kulawa Aramu nakaguhalibisiya mji agu. <verse eid="2KI 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 9:15" />Kumbiti mfalumi Yoramu kawuyiti aku Yezreeli su kaponi vironda vyakapatiti shaka sha kulikomanga nkondu na mfalumi Hazaeli gwa Aramu. Yehu kawagambiriti wakulu wayaguwi, “Payiwera hamjimilirani naneni, muntu yoseri nakalawa Ramoti kugenda Yezreeli kujega visoweru avi.” <verse eid="2KI 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 9:16" />Ndo kakwena mbutuka yakuyi ya kukwega na farasi na kugenda aku Yezreeli. Yoramu kaweriti keniponi na Ahazia mfalumi gwa Yuda kaweriti aku kumtyangira.<verse eid="2KI 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 9:17" />Mlolera yakaweriti pampindi pa shindwalingu sha Yezreeli kalonga, “Mona wantu pawiza na mbutuka!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:17">Yoramu kankula, “Gumsyaguli mkwena farasi yumu, gumtumi su kuliwoni na womberi, kawakosiyi, kwana ponga?”<verse eid="2KI 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 9:18" />Su, mlagilagi ayu pakagenditi kaliwoniti na Yehu na kumgambira, “Mfalumi kakosia. Mwiza kwa ponga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:18">Yehu kankula, “Ntambu gaa gukosiya aku kwana ponga? Gwenga gugalambuki gumfati neni.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:18">Mlolera pampindi pashindwalingu kalonga, “Mlagilagi kasoka, kumbiti kawuyandiri.” <verse eid="2KI 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 9:19" />Shakapanu mlagilagi gwa pili kalagalirwa, viraavilii kamkosiyiti Yehu likosiwu liraaali. Yehu kamgambira ntambu iraa, “Ntambu gaa gunkosiya kuusu ponga? Gwenga gugalambuki gumfati neni!”<verse eid="2KI 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 9:20" />Kwa mala imonga kayi mlolera yakawera pashindwalingu kalonga, mlagilagi kawasokera kumbiti kawuya ndiri. Shakapanu kongera, “Wendesha mbutuka za kukwegwa na farasi ndo handa wa Yehu mwana gwa Nimshi, toziya yomberi katugiziya nentu.”<verse eid="2KI 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 9:21" />Su, Yoramu mfalumi wa Israeli kalagalira pakalonga, “Gutandi mbutuka za kukwega na farasi.” Na womberi wamtandiriti mbutuka yakuyi. Shakapanu Yoramu mfalumi wa Israeli na Ahazia mfalumi gwa Yuda wawukiti kila yumu pakakwena mbutuka yakuyi, wagenda kuliwona na Yehu. Wamwona muluwaga lwa Naboti gwa Yezreeli. <verse eid="2KI 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 9:22" />Payiwera Yoramu, pakamwoniti Yehu, kamkosiya,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:22">“Hashi, gwiza kwa ponga, Yehu?” Yehu kamwankula, “Ponga gaa, shaka wahumba na wahawi wa mawu gwaku Yezebeli ndo wavuwa?”<verse eid="2KI 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 9:23" />Yoramu kagalambula mbutuka yakuyi ya kukwega na farasi na kuwuka, agawu pakamgambira Ahazia, “Agu ndo mgomiziwu Ahazia!” <verse eid="2KI 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 9:24" />Yehu kawutola upindi wakuyi na kwasa msali gweni gupena pakati pamawega ga Yoramu na kusoma moyu gwakuyi, na yomberi kahowa palaa palii mumbutuka mwakuyi ya kukwega na farasi. <verse eid="2KI 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 9:25" />Yehu kamgambira ntumintumi gwakuyi Bidikari, “Gutoli mauti gakuyi gugasili kulirambu ali lya Naboti kulawa Yezireeli. Guliholi gwenga na neni patuweriti tukwena farasi gwetu kumbeli kwa Yoramu tati gwakuyi Ahabu, Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakalongiti visoweru avi kuusu yomberi. <verse eid="2KI 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 9:26" />Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga, toziya malaga ga Naboti na ga wana wakuyi gamoniti mashaka gagapititi nililapa handa hanikuwuzilili mulilambu ali. Hangu, gutoli mauti ga Yoramu gugasi mulilambu lya Naboti ntambu yakalongiti Mtuwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="2KI 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Ahazia gwa Yuda kankulaguwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 9:27" />Ahazia mfalumi gwa Yuda pakawoniti yagalawiliti katugiti kugenda kumji gwa Beti Hagani, agawu pakafatwa na Yehu. Yehu kawahimiziya wantu wakuyi, “Mmulagi viraa na yomberi!” Na womberi wamlasa msali pakawera mbutuka ya kukwega na farasi kunjira ya kukwena Guri pakwegera na mji gwa Ibleamu. Shakapanu kendeleya kugenda mpaka Megido na kuhowera aku. <verse eid="2KI 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 9:28" />Wantumintumi wakuyi wagutola mauti gakuyi mngati mwa mbutuka yakuyi ya kukwenga na farasi na kuyijega Yerusalemu na aku kafindirwa mulisembi lya shifalumi mulushi lwa Dawudi.<verse eid="2KI 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 9:29" />Mushinja sha kumi na moja sha ukolamlima wa Yoramu mwana gwa Ahabu kukolamlima Yuda, ndo Ahazia pakanjiti kakolamlima Israeli.<verse eid="2KI 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malikiya Yezebeli kankulaguwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 9:30" />Yehu pakasokiti aku Yezireeli, Yezebeli kaweriti kapatiti kala visoweru vya vitwatira vyavilawiriti. Kalipakaziya langi mmasu na kuzitula weri viri zakuyi, ndo kagenda kulidilisha na kulola pasi. <verse eid="2KI 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 9:31" />Yehu pakingiriti kuligomi, Yezebeli kalongiti. “Gwiza kwa ponga, gwenga yaguwera handa Zimri! Yaguwalaga watuwa waku?”<verse eid="2KI 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 9:32" />Yehu kalola kumpindi na kulonga “Ndo gaa yakawera uwega waneni?” Wakulu wawili ama watatu walaviya mituwi yawu kumlola kupitira palidilisha, <verse eid="2KI 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 9:33" />na Yehu kawagambira, “Mmwasi mdala ayu pasi!” Wamwasa pasi na mwazi gwakuyi gwitika pampindi pa shibambaza na mufarasi. Shakapanu katimbangatimbanga. <verse eid="2KI 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 9:34" />Su Yehu kingira munumba ya shifalumi na aku kaliya na kulanda. Shakapanu kawalagalila. “Mmufintiri mdala ayu yakapangiriti, toziya kaweliti mhinga gwa mfalumi.” <verse eid="2KI 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 9:35" />Pawalawiti mnumba kugenda kumfintira, kumbiti wawonandiri shoseri ila lubalanga lwa mtuwi, mawoku na lwayu. <verse eid="2KI 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 9:36" />Shakapanu wawuya na kumgambila Yehu visoweru avi, na yomberi kalonga, “Hangu ndo Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakatungiti kupitira kwa ntumintumi gwakuyi Eliya kulawa Tishibi pakalonga, wang'ang'a hawaliyi nshimba ya Yezebeli muisi ya Yezreeli. <verse eid="2KI 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 9:37" />Mauti gakuyi Yezebeli hagapalasiwi handa mapimba mulilambu muisi ya Yezireeli, hangu kwahera yakaweza kummana.”<verse eid="2KI 9:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2KI 10" />
  <para style="s">Wiwuka wa Ahabu wankulaguwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 10:1" />Kumji gwa Samalia kuweriti na wana wapalu sabini wa Ahabu. Yehu kalembiti hamba na kutuma kwa wakolamlima wa mji, kwa walonguziya na wagolokera wa wana wa Ahabu. Luwamba lweni lulonga hangu. <verse eid="2KI 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 10:2" />“Toziya kwana wana wa mfalumi muwamu mwenu, ntambu iraayi mwana farasi na mbutuka za kukwega na farasi, vintu vya kulikomangira na miji ya maboma, <verse eid="2KI 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 10:3" />msyaguli na kumlumika yakana uwezu nentu pakati pa wana wa mfalumi kaweri mfalumi, shakapanu mkomangi nkondu kwajili ya kumlolera mfalumi.”<verse eid="2KI 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 10:4" />Wakolamlima wa Samalia watiriti nentu na kulonga, “Tuwezahashi kumkoma Yehu shaka mfalumi Yoramu na mfalumi Ahazia wasinditi?” <verse eid="2KI 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 10:5" />Su mkulu gwa numba ya mfalumi na mkulu gwa mji, pawawera pamuhera na walonguziya wamonga na walolera, wamjegera Yehu ulagilagi awu. “Twenga twawamanda waku na twakala kutenda shoseri shagulonga. Kumbiti hapeni tumlumiki muntu yoseri kaweri mfalumi, gutendi shaguwona shiheri.”<verse eid="2KI 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 10:6" />Yehu kawalembera hamba zimonga kawagambira. “Payiwera nakaka mwakala kufata malagalira ganeni na mwakala kufata malagalira gangu, mmujegi panu Yazireeli mituwi ya wana wa mtuwa gwenu, niyipati shilawu shaka handa ashi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 10:6">Wana sabini wa mfalumi Ahabu walikaliti kwa walonguziya wa Samalia, weni yawaweriti wankulerwa. <verse eid="2KI 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 10:7" />Su, barua palusokiti wawatoliti wana awa wa mfalumi na kuwalikitula woseri sabini. Watulitwi mituwi yawu mumajamanda na kumjegera Yehu aku Yezireeli.<verse eid="2KI 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 10:8" />“Shaka ntumintumi yumu kamgendera na kulonga, mituwi ya wana wa mfalumi ijegwa kala. Ndo kalagalira, vitulwi pasi mumafungu mawili kuligomi lya mji, shakapanu mvileki vilikali aku mpaka shilawu mandawira.” <verse eid="2KI 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 10:9" />Mandawira shilawu yakuyi kalawa, kagoloka na kuwagambira wantu woseri, “Mwenga ndo mwahera likosa, guloli neni nimgalambuka mtuwa gwangu na kumalaga, Kumbiti ndo gaa kawalagiti woseri awa? <verse eid="2KI 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 10:10" />Muvimani handa visoweru vyoseri vyakalongiti Mtuwa Mlungu kuusu kaya ya Ahabu vitendeka. Mtuwa Mlungu kagatenda aga gakalongiti kwa njira ya ntumintumi gwakuyi Eliya.” <verse eid="2KI 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 10:11" />Shakapanu Yehu kalaga kaya yoseri ya Ahabu yaiweriti yankulikala Yazreeli, pamuhera na wakulu wakuyi na waganja na watambika wakuyi, kamlekandiri muntu yoseri kalikali.<verse eid="2KI 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walongu wa Ahazia wankulaguwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 10:12" />Shakapanu Yehu kawuka Yezireeli. Kagenda Samalia. Pakaweriti mnjira pahala yapashemwa, lugonjeru lwa Washugaji, <verse eid="2KI 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 10:13" />Kaliwoniti na walongu wa malahemu Ahazia, mfalumi gwa Yuda kawakosiya. “Mwenga mwashina gaa?” Wamwankula,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 10:13">“Twenga twawalongu wa Ahazia. Twiza aku kuwakola mawoku wana wa mfalumi na wana wa malikiya.” <verse eid="2KI 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 10:14" />Shakapanu kalonga, “Muwabati pawawera wakomu.” Wawabata wantu alubayini na wawili, wawalagira pakwegera na linegu lya liringu lya Washungaji. Kwahera muntu yakasigaliti ata yumu.<verse eid="2KI 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walongu wa Ahabu yawasigaliti wankulagwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 10:15" />Yehu kalawa kayi na pakasokiti mnjira kaliwona na Yehonadabu mwana gwa Rekabu, Yehu kamlamusiya, shakapanu kumgambira, “Gwenga gwana maholu teratera na gangu? Hashi, haguweli pamuhera na neni na kuntanga?” Yehonadabu kamwankula, “Yina, haweli pamuhera na gwenga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 10:15">Yehu kalonga,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 10:15">“Su gumpanani liwoku lyaku.” Walikolelera mawoku na Yehu kamkweniziya mumbutuka yakuyi. <verse eid="2KI 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 10:16" />Kamgambira, “Gunfati neni su guwoni ntambu yawera mwaminika kwa Mtuwa Mlungu.” Su, wagenda mwanja pamuhera mumbutuka mwakuyi yakukwegwa. <verse eid="2KI 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 10:17" />Pawosokiti Samaria, Yehu kalagiti walongu wakuyi woseri wa Ahabu pota kumleka ata yumu gwawu. Iwera teratera Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamgambiriti Eliya hayiweli.<verse eid="2KI 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu yawamguwira Mlungu Baali wankulaguwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 10:18" />Yehu kawajonjonira wantu wa Samaria na kuwagambira, “Mfalumi Ahabu kamgendiriti Baali padidini hera, Kumbiti neni hanimtendeli. <verse eid="2KI 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 10:19" />Guwashemi wambuyi woseri wa Baali, wantumintumi wakuyi woseri na watambika. Ndo mpaka kila yumu kasoki, toziya nfira kumlavilira Baali tambiku nkulu na yoseri yakasinda kusoka hakalagwi.” Ayi iweriti ndo galambuka ya Yehu su kapati kuwalaga wantumintumi wa Baali. <verse eid="2KI 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 10:20" />Yehu kalonga. “Mshemi lijojoniku likulu lya kumguwira mlungu Baali!” Su libweru lilaviwa, <verse eid="2KI 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 10:21" />na Yehu kajega shisoweru muisi yoseri ya Israeli su wantumintumi woseri wa Baali wasoki kila yumu. Wasoka woseri na kumema nduu munumba ya Baali kulawa pembi yimu mpaka yimonga. <verse eid="2KI 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 10:22" />Hangu Yehu kamlagalira yakagolokiriti nguwu zazitulitwi gweka za kumguwira mlungu Baali pakalonga, “Gulaviyi nguwu azi na kuwapanana wantu yawasokiti kumguwira mlungu Baali.” Mgolokera kalaviya nguwu azi, kawapanana. <verse eid="2KI 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 10:23" />Shakapanu Yehu kasokiti mulihekalu lya Baali pakalikolana na Yehonadabu na kuwagambira yawaweriti mulihekalu, “Mloli weri handa yawaweriti mnumba nkulu ndo walii yawamguwira Baali hera, na handa kwahera muntu yoseri yakamguwira Mtuwa Mlungu.” <verse eid="2KI 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 10:24" />Shakapanu kingira pamuhera na Yehonadabu kumlavirira Baali malaviwu na tambiku za kulunguziwa tolosu. Yehu kaweriti katula wantu semanini kunja ku numba ayi ya kutambikira na kuwapanana malagaliru aga, “Muwalagi wantu awa woseri. Yoseri yakamleka ata yumu gwawu katugi hakalaguwi yombeli!”<verse eid="2KI 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 10:25" />Shakapanu Yehu pakamaliliti kulaviya tambiku ya kulunguziwa tolosu, kawagambiriti walolera na wakulu, “Mwingiri mkawalagi woseri. Nammuleka ata yumu katugi!” Wingira kala na magumba gawu na kulaga woseri, shakapanu walaviya shiwembu shawu kunja. Ndo wingira mulihekalu, <verse eid="2KI 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 10:26" />na kulaviya mpanda yakumguwira Baali na kushilunguziya tolosu kwa motu. <verse eid="2KI 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 10:27" />Wahalibisiya mpanda ya Baali pamuhera na numba, waigalambula numba iwera showu, hangu ndo ntambu yayiwera mpaka leru.<verse eid="2KI 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 10:28" />Hangu Yehu ndo ntambu yakawusiyiti kumguwira Baali Muisraeli. <verse eid="2KI 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 10:29" />Kumbiti kendeleyiti kutenda vidoda handa Yeroboamu mwana gwa Nebati kwa kuwalonguziya Waisraeli watendi vidoda. Katuliti shinyagu sha mwana gwa ng'ombi shipalu gwa zahabu aku Beteli na Dani. <verse eid="2KI 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 10:30" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira Yehu, “Guwatendera wiwuka wa Ahabu goseri galii ganfiriti guwatenderi. Hangu nikugambiziya kuwera walelwa waku mpaka wiwuka wa msheshi hawakolimlima isi ya Israeli.” <verse eid="2KI 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 10:31" />Kumbiti Yehu kajimira ndiri lagaliru lya Mtuwa Mlungu gwa Israeli, kwa moyu gwakuyi goseri. Yomberi, kafatiti vyakatenditi Yeroboamu kwakuwatenda wantu wa Israeli watenda vidoda.<verse eid="2KI 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhowa kwa Yehu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 10:32" />Shaka ashi Mtuwa Mlungu kanjiti kupungula ukulu wa isi ya Israeli. Mfalumi Hazaeli gwa Aramu kapatola pahala pakulu pa isi ya Israeli, <verse eid="2KI 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 10:33" />kulawa uwega wa kushana wa lushemba lwa Yoridani na isi ya Gileyadi na Gadi na Reubeni na Manase na kulawa Aroeri yaguwera kululalanda lwa Arinoni kuisi ya Gileyadi na Bashani.<verse eid="2KI 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 10:34" />Mirandu imonga yoseri ga Yehu na vitendu vyakuyi vya ugangamala vilembwa mu Shitabu sha Maholu ga Wafalumi wa Israeli. <verse eid="2KI 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 10:35" />Na Yehu kahowa na kufintilwa Samalia. Mwana gwakuyi Yehoahazi kakolamlima pahala pakuyi. <verse eid="2KI 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 10:36" />Yehu kakolitimlima Israeli pakawera kumji gwa Samalia kwa vinja ishilini na nani.<verse eid="2KI 10:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2KI 11" />
  <para style="s">Malikiya Atalia gwa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 22:10">2 Mirandu 22:10</ref>,<ref loc="2CH 23:15">23:15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 11:1" />Katepu Atalia mawu gwakuyi mfalumi Ahazia, pakawoniti kuwera mwana gwakuyi kalagwa kalagaliliti, kaya yoseri ya shifalumi ilagwi. <verse eid="2KI 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 11:2" />Kumbiti Yehosheba mhinga gwa mfalumi Yehoramu, dada gwakuyi Ahazia, kamtoliti kwa bada Yoashi mwana gwa Ahazia, kulawa muwamu mwa wana wa mfalumi yawaweriti pakwegera kulagwa. Kamfifiti yomberi pamuhera na yaya gwakuyi mushumba sha kugonja. Hangu wamfifiti su Atalia kamwonindiri na kumlaga. <verse eid="2KI 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 11:3" />Yehosheba kamfifiti Yoashi kwavinja sita shaka ashi kaweriti kafifwa mngati mwa mu Hekalu, shaka Atalia pakaweriti kakolamlima isi.<verse eid="2KI 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 11:4" />Kumbiti mushinja sha saba mtambika Yehoyada kalagaliriti ulagilagi na kuwajojonira wakulu wa mashonta na walolela wa shifalumi na walolela, kawagambira wamwiziri mu Hekalu na yomberi katenda nawa mapatanu na kuwalapisiya waweri waminika mu Hekalu amu. Shakapanu kawalanguzia Yoashi mwana gwa mfalumi Ahazia. <verse eid="2KI 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 11:5" />Viraavirii kalonga. “Hamtendi hangu, mwenga yamuwera muvipinga vitatu pamsoka kutenda lihengu Mulishaka lya kwoyera, shipinga shimu hashiloleli numba ya mfalumi, <verse eid="2KI 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 11:6" />shipinga shimonga hashiloleli ligomi lya Suri na yashisigaliti hashiloleli kuligomi pamberi pa walolera. Hangu ndo ntambu yanamloleri, su liboma lya mfalumi nayimegwa. <verse eid="2KI 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 11:7" />Vipinga viwili vyeni vimalira ulolera wawu lishaka lya kwoyera vikoli lolera mu Hekalu kumlolera mfalumi. <verse eid="2KI 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 11:8" />Mumloleri mfalumi Yoashi, kila muntu na vintu vya kulikomangila vyakuyi muliwoku na muntu yoseri yakafira kuwasegelera kalaguwi. Mpaka mlikali na mfalumi, kaweri kankulawa ama kankulikala.”<verse eid="2KI 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 11:9" />Wakulu wa mashonta wajimiriti lagila zoseri zyakalaviyiti mtambika Yehoyada. Kila mkulu gwa lishonta kawatola wantu wakuyi woseri, walii yawaweriti wamalira lolera na walii yawaweriti wakwingira lishaka lya Kwoyera, su wamgendera mtambika Yehoyada. <verse eid="2KI 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 11:10" />Shakapanu kawapanana wakulu wa mashonta migoha na nsegeyu zyaziweriti zya mfalumi Daudi na zyeni ziweriti mnumba ya Mtuwa Mlungu, <verse eid="2KI 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 11:11" />na walolela wagolokiriti kwanjira uwega wa kusika wa Hekalu mpaka uwega wa kushana wa Hekalu na kuzyengeta shitalawanda sha Hekalu su kumzyengeta mfalumi, kila muntu kaweriti kakola vikomangira mumawoku mwakuyi. <verse eid="2KI 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 11:12" />Shakapanu kamlaviya kunja mwana gwa mfalumi na kumpanana malagaliru ga shifalumi, kamvalizia lijenjeri mumtuwi na kumbwera kuwera mfalumi, wamlumika na kummiminira lipaki, wakoma vipopu na kulonga, “Kalikali mfalumi!”<verse eid="2KI 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 11:13" />Atalia pakapikaniriti liziwu lya walolela pamuhera na wantu wamonga, kawagendiriti wantu awa yawaweriti mu Hekalu. <verse eid="2KI 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 11:14" />Pakasunguliriti kamwona mfalumi gwasyayi kagoloka pakwegera na mpanda kuligomi lya Hekalu gambira ntambu yawu, aku wakulu wa mashonta wagomba magoli pawawera pambwega pa mfalumi na wenikaya woseri pawanemelera na kugomba magoli, ndo kapapuliti nguwu yakuyi na kubota, “Tugalambukwa! Tugalambukwa!”<verse eid="2KI 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 11:15" />Shakapanu mtambika Yehoyada kawagambira wakulu wa mashonta pakalonga, “Mumlaviyi kunja pakati pa lishonta, na kalagwi muntu yoseri yakafirakumfata.” Toziya mtambika kalongiti, “Nakalagwa mu Hekalu.” <verse eid="2KI 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 11:16" />Su, wambata, wamjega na kumpitizia Kuligomi lya Farasi kugenda kuliboma na yomberi kalaguwa aku.<verse eid="2KI 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yehoyada kankugalambura mirandu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 23:16-21">2 Mirandu 23:16-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 11:17" />Shakapanu Yehoyada katenda lipatanu pakati pa Mtuwa Mlungu na Mfalumi na wantu, handa hawaweli wantu wa Mtuwa Mlungu. Ntambu iraayi katenditi lipatanu pakati pa mfalumi na wantu. <verse eid="2KI 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 11:18" />Shakapanu wenikaya woseri wagenda kulihekalu lya Baali na kuyibomola, wameganga shitalawanda pamuhera na vinyagu vyakuyi, ata wamlaga Matani mtambika gwa Baali palongolu pa shitalawanda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 11:18">Mtambika Yehoyada katula walolela waloleli kuhekalu <verse eid="2KI 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 11:19" />Kawatoliti wakulu wa mashonta, walolera wakuyi mfalumi na walolera wa liboma na wenikaya woseri na womberi wagenda pamuhera na mfalumi kulawa Mulihekalu pawapitira muligomi lya walolela mpaka kuliboma nayomberi kakolitimlima. <verse eid="2KI 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 11:20" />Hangu, wenikaya woseri wamemitwi nemeleru na mji goseri guweriti na ponga, pa Atalia kulaguwa kwa ligumba muliboma.<verse eid="2KI 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 11:21" />Yoashi kanjiti kukolamlima Yuda pakawera na vinja saba.<verse eid="2KI 11:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2KI 12" />
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Yoashi gwa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 24:1-16">2 Mirandu 24:1-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 12:1" />Mushinja sha saba sha ukolamlima wa mfalumi Yehu gwa Israeli, Yoashi kanjiti kukolamlima Yuda aku Yerusalemu, yomberi kakolitimlima kwa vinja alobayini aku Yerusalemu. Mawu gwakuyi kaweriti Sibiya, kulawa Beeri Sheba. <verse eid="2KI 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 12:2" />Mukulikala kwakuyi kwoseri katenditi maheri palongolu pa Mtuwa Mlungu, toziya mtambika mkulu Yehoyada kaweriti kankumfunda. <verse eid="2KI 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 12:3" />Ata hangu, pahala pampindi pakuguwira wamlungu pahalibisiwandiri na wantu wendereyiti kutambikira na kutumiziya ubani aku.<verse eid="2KI 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 12:4" />Yoashi kawashema watambika wa Mlungu na kuwalagalira, pakalonga, “Mpiya zoseri yazijegwa mu Hekalu handa tambiku nanagala payiwera ijegwa toziya ya kuwalanga wantu ama ilawa kulawirana na nazili ama mpiya zoseri yazijegwa handa lifupu, <verse eid="2KI 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 12:5" />watambika wanki kulawa kwa kila muntu na womberi wanyawi syayi numba zoseri zyazifiruwa kunyawa syayi.”<verse eid="2KI 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 12:6" />Kumbiti ata pamberi pa vinja ishilini na tatu wa ukolamlima wa mfalumi Yoashi watambika waweriti watendandiri manyawa goseri ga numba. <verse eid="2KI 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 12:7" />Hangu mfalumi Yoashi kamshemiti mtambika Yehoyada na watambika wamonga na kuwakosiya, “Hashi mnyawandiri Hekalu? Su, namtola mpiya kulawa kwa wantu yawatula ila mzijegi, su numba inyawiwi syayi.” <verse eid="2KI 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 12:8" />Watambika wajimira nawanka mpiya kayi kulawa kwa wantu na viraa wajimirana nawatenda kayi manyawa ga Hekalu<verse eid="2KI 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 12:9" />Yehoyada katola lisanduku na kutobola shitoboli kushifuniku shakuyi, shakapanu kashitula kushitalawanda uwega wa kumliwu wa muntu pakingira Kuhekalu. Na watambika yawaweriti mlihengu kuligomi watuliti mpiya zoseri zyazijegitwi mu Hekalu. <verse eid="2KI 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 12:10" />Kila pawawona kwana mpiya zivuwa mlisanduku, mlemba gwa mfalumi na watambika wingiriti wazilaviya na kuwalanga na kuzitawa mushifungu sha feza zoseri zyazipatikaniti mu Hekalu. <verse eid="2KI 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 12:11" />Shakapanu pawazipimiti kala wawapananiti watenda lihengu yawagolokiriti Hekalu na womberi wawalipa wanyawa mbawu na wanyawa numba, wawanyawiti syayi numba ya Mtuwa Mlungu, <verse eid="2KI 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 12:12" />Viraa wanyawa mbawu na wapantanga mabuwi, zitenderwa kuhemelera mbawu na mabuwi yagasongolitwi su kutenda manyawa syayi ga Hekalu <verse eid="2KI 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 12:13" />Kumbiti mpiya azi zitenderwandiri kwa kulipira unyawa wa mabakuli yaganyawitwi kwa madini ga feza, mikasi ya kudumulira tambi za mimiliku zyaziweriti Muhekalu, mabakuli na mapenga, pota kwa vyombu vimonga vyoseri vya zahabu ama vya feza. <verse eid="2KI 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 12:14" />Zoseri zitendiritwi kwa kuwalipa watenda lihengu yawazitenderiti kutenda manyawa syayi ga Hekalu. <verse eid="2KI 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 12:15" />Watenda mahengu yawagolokiriti lihengu ali waweriti waaminka nentu, wafiruwandiri kulonga ntambu yawazitenderiti feza azi. <verse eid="2KI 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 12:16" />Mpiya zyazilaviyitwi kuwera tambiku ya kuwusiya likosa na tambiku za kuwusiya vidoda ziyingiziwandiri mu Hekalu, azi ziweriti za watambika.<verse eid="2KI 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 12:17" />Shipindi ashi Hazaeli mfalumi wa Aramu kagukomanga mji gwa Gati na kugulopola. Shakapanu Hazaeli kagenditi Yerusalemu su kagukomangi, <verse eid="2KI 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 12:18" />Yoashi mfalumi gwa Yuda katoliti tambiku zoseri zyazilumikitwi na wambuyi wakuyi wafalumi wa Yuda. Yehoshafati na Yehoramu na Ahazia na kongera zilii zakuyi, pamuhera na zahabu yoseri yayiweriti muluhanja lwa Hekalu na muliboma, kazituma kwa Hazaeli mfalumi gwa Aramu. Na yomberi Hazaeli kawuka na kayikomangandiri Yerusalemu.<verse eid="2KI 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 12:19" />Mirandu imonga yoseri ya mfalumi Yoashi ilembwa mu Shitabu sha Maholu ga Wafalumi wa Yuda.<verse eid="2KI 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 12:20" />Walonguziya wakuyi wa mashonta wagalambukiti, wamlagira aku Beti Milu munjira yayigenda Sila. <verse eid="2KI 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 12:21" />Yawamlagiti ndo Yozakari mwana gwa Shimeati na Yehozabadi mwana gwa Shomeri wantumintumi wakuyi. Shakapanu Yoashi wamfintira mumasembi ga shifalumi mumji gwa Dawudi. Na Amazia mwana gwakuyi, kakolamlima pahala pakuyi.<verse eid="2KI 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2KI 13" />
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Yehoahazi gwa Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 13:1" />Mushinja sha ishilini na tatu sha ukolamlima wa mfalumi Yoashi gwa Yuda, Yehoahazi mwana gwa Yehu kanjiti kukolamlima Israeli, kendereya kukolamlima aku Samaria kwa vinja kumi na saba. <verse eid="2KI 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 13:2" />Katenditi vidoda palongolu pa Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakatenditi mfalumi Yeruboamu mwana gwa Nebati, yakawatenditi wantu wa Israeli watenda vidoda. Yehoahazi kalekandiri matendu aga madoda. <verse eid="2KI 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 13:3" />Mtuwa Mlungu kakalaliti, kawatenda wantu wa Israeli wasindi kunkondu mala zivuwa na mfalumi Hazaeli gwa Aramu na mwana gwakuyi Beni Hadadi. <verse eid="2KI 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 13:4" />Yehoahazi kamluwa Mtuwa Mlungu na Mtuwa Mlungu kapikanira maluwa gakuyi pakawoniti mfalumi gwa Aramu ntambu yakawayoniriti wantu wa Israeli. <verse eid="2KI 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 13:5" />Mtuwa Mlungu kawapanana wantu wa Israeli mlonguziya yakawalopoliti kulawa kwa Waaramu, ndo walikala kwa ponga ntambu yawaweriti mashaka gapititi. <verse eid="2KI 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 13:6" />Ata hangu walekandiri kutenda vidoda vyeni mfalumi Yeruboamu kawatenda wantu wa Israeli watendi vidoda, nentu ya aga wendereyiti na vidoda vyawu na shinyagu sha wamlungu wa shidala Ashera shashitulitwi aku Samalia.<verse eid="2KI 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 13:7" />Yehoahazi kaweritindiri na mashonta, ilahera wakwena farasi amusini, mbutuka kumi na lishonta lya magulu elufi kumi. Ayi iweriti toziya ya mfalumi gwa Aramu kaweriti kagagamaziya mashonta ga Israeli na kugaposholanga pasi handa lidikudiku.<verse eid="2KI 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 13:8" />Matendu gamonga goseri ga Yehoahazi na ugangamala wakuyi galembitwi mu Shitabu sha Maholu ga wafalumi wa Israeli.<verse eid="2KI 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 13:9" />Yehoahazi kahowiti na kufintirwa aku Samalia na Yehoashi mwana gwakuyi kawera mfalumi pahala pakuyi.<verse eid="2KI 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Yehoashi gwa Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 13:10" />Mushinja lwa selasini na saba sha ukolamlima wa Mfalumi Yoashi gwa Yuda, Yehoashi mwana gwakuyi Yehoahazi, kanjiti kukolamlima Israeli aku Samaria na ukolamlima wakuyi wendereya kwa vinja kumi na sita. <verse eid="2KI 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 13:11" />Yehoashi viraa katenditi vidoda kwa Mtuwa Mlungu na kufata vyakatenditi mfalumi Yeruboamu mwana gwa Nebati mweni kawapotuziyiti wantu wa Israeli. <verse eid="2KI 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 13:12" />Matendu gamonga goseri gakatenditi Yehoashi, ugangamala wakuyi mu nkondu zyakalikomangiti na mfalumi Amazia gwa Yuda, galembwitwi mu Shitabu sha Maholu ga Wafalumi wa Israeli. <verse eid="2KI 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 13:13" />Yehoashi kahowiti na kufintirwa mu masembi ga shifalumi aku Samalia na mwana gwakuyi Yeruboamu gwa pili kakolamlima pahala pakuyi.<verse eid="2KI 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhowa kwa Elisha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 13:14" />Elisha yakaweriti mbuyi gwa Mlungu kalwaliti ulweri udoda nentu. Pakaweriti layilayi, mfalumi Yehoashi gwa Israeli kamtyangiriti. Pakamoniti Elisha, kaliliti pakalonga, “Tati gwangu, tati gwangu! Gwenga ndo mlolera mkulu gwa Israeli guwuka!”<verse eid="2KI 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 13:15" />Elisha kamgambira, “Gunjegeli upindi na misali!” Yehoashi kavijega, <verse eid="2KI 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 13:16" />“Elisha kamgambira kalitandi kuguma misali. Mfalumi kalitanda na Elisha kagatula mawoku gakuyi pampindi pamawoku ga mfalumi.” <verse eid="2KI 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 13:17" />Mfalumi kafata malagalira ga mbuyi gwa Mlungu na kuvugula lidilisha lyaliloliti Aramu. Elisha kamgambira, “Gwasi msali!” Katepu mfalumi pakasiti msali, muntu gwa Mlungu kalonga, “Agu ndo msali Mtuwa Mlungu hakapati ukanka kwa Waaramu. Hagulikomangi na Waaramu yawawera aku Afeki mpaka guwakanki.”<verse eid="2KI 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 13:18" />“Elisha ndo kamgambira mfalumi katoli misali imonga na kuikoma pasi. Mfalumi kaikoma misali pasi mala ntatu, shakapanu koya.” <verse eid="2KI 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 13:19" />Elisha kakalaliti nentu, kamgambira mfalumi, “Hashi gugumandiri mala mhanu ama sita? Hangu haguwalagi Waaramu nakamu. Kumbiti vinu haguwakanki mala ntatu hera.”<verse eid="2KI 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 13:20" />Elisha kahowiti na kufintirwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 13:20">Kila shinja, vipinga vya Wamoabu wiza kuyikomanga isi ya wantu wa Israeli. <verse eid="2KI 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 13:21" />Shaka shimu, shaka sha kufintira, wantu wawoniti shipinga shimu sha wakondu shakwiza wasa mauti galii mlisembi lya Elisha na kutuga. Katepuhera mauti galii pagashinkuliti mihonju ya Elisha, kazyukiti na kugoloka.<verse eid="2KI 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkondu pakati pa Israeli na Aramu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 13:22" />Mfalumi Hazaeli gwa Aramu kawayoniriti nentu wantu wa Israeli shaka shoseri sha ukolamlima wa Yehoahazi. <verse eid="2KI 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 13:23" />Kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti mheri na kawawonera lusungu. Kawalekandiri walaguwi ila kwatanga toziya ya lipatanu lyakuyi na Abrahamu na Isaka na Yakobu, kayaluwandiri wantu wakuyi mpaka leru.<verse eid="2KI 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 13:24" />Hazaeli mfalumi gwa Shamu pakahowiti, Beni Hadadi mwana gwakuyi kakolitimlima pahala pakuyi. <verse eid="2KI 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 13:25" />Mfalumi Yehoashi kamkangiti Beni Hadadi mala ntatu na kuyikombola miji yoseri yailopolitwi shaka sha ukolamlima wa Yehoahazi, tati gwakuyi Yehoashi.<verse eid="2KI 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2KI 14" />
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Amazia gwa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 25:1-24">2 Mirandu 25:1-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 14:1" />Mushinja sha pili sha ukolamlima wa Yehoashi mwana gwa Yehoahazi aku Israeli, Amazia mwana gwa Yoashi mfalumi gwa Yuda kanjiti kokalamlima, <verse eid="2KI 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 14:2" />pakanjiti kukolamlima kaweriti na vinja ishilini na mhanu na yomberi kakolitimlima Yerusalemu kwa shaka sha vinja ishilini na tisa. Mawu gwakuyi kashemitwi Yehoadini kulawa Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2KI 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 14:3" />Katenditi maheri palongolu pa Mtuwa Mlungu, kumbiti kaweritindiri mwaminika nakamu ntambu yakaweriti mbuyi gwakuyi Dawudi. Su katenditi mirandu yoseri handa Yoashi tati gwakuyi. <verse eid="2KI 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 14:4" />Ata hangu pahala pa kuguwira kumigongu pahalibisiwandiri na wantu wendireyiti kutambikira na kutumiziya ubani pahala panu.<verse eid="2KI 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 14:5" />Katepu hera Amaziya pakaligangamaziyiti muukolamlima, kawalagiti wakulu yawamlagiti mfalumi Yoashi tati gwakuyi. <verse eid="2KI 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 14:6" />Kumbiti kawalagandiri wana wa walaga, ntambu yayilembitwi mu Shitabu sha Lagiru lya Musa, palii Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga, “Walela hawalaguwindiri toziya ya wana wawu na wana hapeni walaguwi toziya ya walela wawu, kumbuti kila muntu hakalagwi toziya ya vidoda vyakuyi mweni.”<verse eid="2KI 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 14:7" />Amazia kawalagiti wamashonta wa Edomu elufi lirongu Mululalanda lya Munu, kagutoliti kwa makakala mji gwa Sela na kugushema Yekiteeli na hangu ndo ntambu yagushemwa mpaka vinu.<verse eid="2KI 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 14:8" />Shakapanu Amazia kawalagalira walagilagi kwa Yehoashi mwana gwa Yehoahazi, mwana gwa Yehu mfalumi gwa Israeli pakalonga, “Gwizi tulikomangi.” <verse eid="2KI 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 14:9" />Kumbiti mfalumi Yehoashi kamwuzilira ulagilagi Amaziya mfalumi gwa Israeli, pakalonga, “Lishaka limu mmbigili gwa Lebanoni kagugambiriti mwelezi, gwa aku Lebanoni, gumheteri mhinga gwaku kwa mwana gwangu. Kumbiti nkanyama gwa kushitogolu kapita panu na kugutimbangatimbanga mmbigili agu. <verse eid="2KI 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 14:10" />Vinu gwenga Amazia guwakanga nakamu Waedomu, gulitumba. Gutosiwi na uweru waku, gwankulikali ukaya, ntambu gaa kulisakulira ntabika zyazifira kukwagamiziya gwenga gamweni pamuhera na wantu waku wa Yuda?”<verse eid="2KI 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 14:11" />Kumbiti Amazia kalisherandiri. Hangu Yehoashi mfalumi gwa Israeli kalawiti kuliwona sheni kwa sheni na Amazia kunkondu aku Beti Shemeshi, muisi ya Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 14:12" />Wamashonta wa Yuda wakankitwi na wamashonta wa Israeli na kila yumu kawuyiti ukaya kwakuyi. <verse eid="2KI 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 14:13" />Yehoashi mfalumi gwa Israeli kamlopoliti Amahazi mfalumi gwa Yuda, mwana gwa Yehoashi, mwana gwa Ahazia aku Beti Shemeshi, shakapanu kagugendera mji gwa Yerusalemu na kushibomola shibambaza shakuyi kulawa Ligomi lya Efraimu mpaka Ligomi lya Pambwega, utali wa pakwegera mita mia mbili. <verse eid="2KI 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 14:14" />Katoliti zahabu yoseri na madini ga feza, ata na vintu vyoseri vyaviweriti mu Hekalu na muluhanja lwa liboma, viraa katoliti lopola, shakapanu kawuya Samaria.<verse eid="2KI 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 14:15" />Matendu gamonga goseri ga Yehoashi, ugangamala wakuyi na nkondu ntambu yakalikomangiti na mfalumi Amazia gwa Yuda galembwa Muvitabu vya Maholu ga Wafalumi wa Israeli. <verse eid="2KI 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 14:16" />Yehoashi kahowiti, kafindirwa mumasembi ga shifalumi aku Samaria. Mwana gwakuyi, Yeruboamu kakolitimlima pahala pakuyi.<verse eid="2KI 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhowa kwa mfalumi Amazia gwa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 25:25-28">2 Mirandu 25:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 14:17" />Amazia mwana gwa Yoashi mfalumi gwa Yuda kalikaliti vinja kumi na tanu pa mfalumi Yehoashi gwa Israeli kuhowa. <verse eid="2KI 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 14:18" />Matendu gamonga goseri ga Amazia galembwa Mushitabu sha Maholu ga Wafalumi wa Yuda.<verse eid="2KI 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 14:19" />Watenditi majimiranu ga bada kumlaga Amazia aku Yerusalemu, hangu katugiriti Lakishi, kumbiti walagaliriti wantu nakumlaga aku. <verse eid="2KI 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 14:20" />Mauti gakuyi gajegwa pampindi pa farasi na kufindirwa mumasembi ga shifalumi aku Yerusalemu mumji gwa Dawudi. <verse eid="2KI 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 14:21" />Shakapanu wantu woseri wa Yuda wamtola Uzia pakawera na vinja kumi na sita, wamlumikiti pahala pa Amazia tati gwakuyi <verse eid="2KI 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 14:22" />Pakahowiti kala tati gwakuyi, Uzia kagunyawa syayi mji gwa Elati na kuguwuziya Yuda.<verse eid="2KI 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeruboamu gwa pili mfalumi gwa Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 14:23" />Mushinja sha kumi na tanu sha ukolamlima wa Amazia mwana gwa Yoashi mfalumi gwa Yuda, Yeruboamu mwana gwa Yehoashi mfalumi gwa Israeli kanjiti kukolamlima aku Samaria, kakolamlima kwa vinja alubayini na moja. <verse eid="2KI 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 14:24" />Katenda makontola pamasu ga Mtuwa Mlungu kafata mfanu gwa mlongolera gwakuyi mfalumi Yeruboamu mwana gwa Nebati, yakawapotuziyiti wantu wa Israeli watenda vidoda. <verse eid="2KI 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 14:25" />Yomberi kawuziyiti mbaka zoseri za Israeli, kulawa libokera lya Hamati mpaka Bahari ya Araba. Hangu ntambu yakalongiti Mtuwa Mlungu kupitira ntumintumi gwakuyi Yona mwana gwa Amatayi, mbuyi gwa Mlungu, kulawa Gati Heferi.<verse eid="2KI 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 14:26" />Toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kawoniti ntabiku nkulu yawapatiti Waisraeli mana paweritindiri na muntu yoseri gwa kuwatanga. <verse eid="2KI 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 14:27" />Kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu kaweritindiri kalonga handa hakayiyagamiziyi Israeli nakamu, hangu kawalopoliti kwa kupitira mfalumi Yeruboamu mwana gwa Yehoashi.<verse eid="2KI 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 14:28" />Matendu gamonga goseri ga Yeroboamu, nkondu yakalikomangiti kwa ugangamala na ntambu yakayilopoliti Damasiko na Hamati na kuyitenda iweri ya Israeli, goseri galembwa mu Shitabu sha Maholu ga Wafalumi wa Israeli. <verse eid="2KI 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 14:29" />Yeruboamu kahowiti na kufindirwa mumasembi ga shifalumi na mwana gwakuyi yawamshemiti Zekaria kakolamlima pahala pakuyi.<verse eid="2KI 14:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2KI 15" />
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Uzia gwa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 26:1-23">2 Mirandu 26:1-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 15:1" />Mushinja sha ishilini na saba sha ukolamlima wa Yeroboamu gwa pili mfalumi gwa Israeli, Uzia mwana gwa Amazia kanjiti kukolamlima aku Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 15:2" />Kaweriti na vinja kumi na sita pakanjiti kukolamlima. Kakolitimlima kwa vinja amusini na mbili aku Yerusalemu. Mawu kashemitwi Yekolia kulawa Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2KI 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 15:3" />Katenditi maheri palongolu pa Mtuwa Mlungu teratera na goseri gakatenditi Amazia tati gwakuyi. <verse eid="2KI 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 15:4" />Ata hangu pahala pakuguwira kulugongu pahalibisiwitwindiri na wantu wendiriyiti kutambikira na kutumiziya ubani aku. <verse eid="2KI 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 15:5" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamkoma kwa ulweri wa ungumbula mpaka pakahowiti. Kalikaliti munumba yagweka yakuyi na Yotamu mwana gwa mfalumi kawera mgolokera gwa Numba ya shifalumi na kukolamlima wantu wa isi.<verse eid="2KI 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 15:6" />Mirandu imonga yoseri ya Uzia ilembwa mu Shitabu sha Maholu ga Wafalumi wa Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 15:7" />Uzia kahowiti na kufindirwa mumasembi ga wafalumi kumji gwa Dawudi na mwana gwakuyi Yotamu kakolitimlima pahala pakuyi.<verse eid="2KI 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Zekaria gwa Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 15:8" />Mushinja sha selasini nanani sha ukolamlima wa Uzia mfalumi gwa Yuda, Zekaria mwana gwa Yeroboamu kanjiti kukolamlima Israeli pakawera ku Samalia, kakolitimlima kwa shaka sha miyezi sita. <verse eid="2KI 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 15:9" />Na yomberi, handa walongolera wakuyi, katenditi makontola palongolu pa Mtuwa Mlungu. Kafatiti mfanu mdoda gwa mfalumi Yeroboamu mwana gwa Nebati, mweni kawatenda wana wa Israeli watenda vidoda. <verse eid="2KI 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 15:10" />Shalumu mwana gwa Yabeshi katenditi majimiranu ga bada ga kumlaga mfalumi Zekariya, kamkomanga palongolu pa wantu na kumlaga, shakapanu kakolamlima pahala pakuyi.<verse eid="2KI 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 15:11" />Mirandu imonga yoseri ya Zekaria ilembwa mu Shitabu sha Maholu ga Wafalumi wa Israeli.<verse eid="2KI 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 15:12" />Hangu shisoweru sha Mtuwa Mlungu shakamgambiriti mfalumi Yehu shitendeka, pakalonga, “Wiwuka waku hawukolimlima Israeli mpaka viyiwuku vya msheshi.”<verse eid="2KI 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Shalumu gwa Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 15:13" />Mushinja sha selasini na tisa sha ukolamlima wa mfalumi Uzia gwa Yuda, Shalumu mwana gwa Yabeshi kanjiti kukolamlima Israeli, kakolitimlima pakawera aku Samalia kwa shaka sha mwezi gumu.<verse eid="2KI 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 15:14" />Manehemu mwana gwa Gadi kawukiti Tiriza kugenda Samaria na aku kamlaga Shalumu mwana gwa Yabeshi, shakapanu kakolamlima pahala pakuyi. <verse eid="2KI 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 15:15" />Mirandu imonga yoseri ya Shalumu na majimiranu gakuyi ga bada goseri gakatenditi, galembwa mu Shitabu sha Maholu ga Wafalumi wa Israeli. <verse eid="2KI 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 15:16" />Menahemu pakaweriti mnjira kulawa Tiriza, kagubomola mji gwa Tapua na kuwalaga wenikaya wakuyi pamuhera na isi yoseri yakaizyengekiti, toziya walemiti kukolwamlima na yomberi. Su kawatumbuliti wadala wana zinda woseri.<verse eid="2KI 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Menahemu gwa Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 15:17" />Mushinja sha selasini na tisa sha ukolamlima wa mfalumi Uzia gwa Yuda, Menahemu mwana gwa Gadi kanjiti kukolamlima Israeli, kakolitimlima pakawera aku Samalia kwa vinja lilongu. <verse eid="2KI 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 15:18" />Yeroboamu katenditi makontola kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu mashaka goseri ga ukolamlima kalekandiri makontola ga Yeroboamu mwana gwa Nebati, mweni kawatenditi wantu wa Israeli watenda vidoda. <verse eid="2KI 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 15:19" />Shakapanu, Puli mfalumi gwa Ashuru, kayikankala Israeli na Menahemu kampanana kilu selasini na msheshi za feza su kamtangi kugangamaziya ukolamlima muisi ya Israeli. <verse eid="2KI 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 15:20" />Menahemu kapatiti mpiya azi kwa kukakaniziya walunda wa Israeli kulaviya mshangu gwa vipandi amusini vya feza kila yumu. Shakapanu Puli kalikalandiri Israeli su kawuyiti muisi yakuyi.<verse eid="2KI 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 15:21" />Matendu gamonga goseri ga Menahemu galembwa mu Shitabu sha Maholu ga Wafalumi wa Israeli. <verse eid="2KI 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 15:22" />Menahemu kahowiti na mwana gwakuyi Pekahia kakolitimlima pahala pakuyi.<verse eid="2KI 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Pekahia gwa Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 15:23" />Mushinja sha amusini sha ukolamlima wa mfalumi Uzia gwa Yuda, Pekahia mwana gwa Menahemu kanjiti kukolamlima Israeli, kakolitimlima pakawera aku Samalia kwa shaka sha vinja viwili. <verse eid="2KI 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 15:24" />Katenditi makontola kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu na kufata mfanu mdoda gwa mfalumi Yeroboamu mwana gwa Nebati, mweni kawatenditi wantu wa Israeli watendi vidoda. <verse eid="2KI 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 15:25" />Peka mwana gwa Remalia, ndo kaweriti mkulu gwa lishonta lya Pekahia, pawaweriti pamuhera na wantu wamonga amusini kulawa Gileadi, kamlaga Pekahia muliboma lya mngati mwa liboma lya mfalumi pakawera aku Samalia na kawera mfalumi pahala pakuyi.<verse eid="2KI 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 15:26" />Matendu gamonga ga Pekahia na goseri gakatenditi galembwa mu Shitabu sha Maholu ga wafalumi wa Israeli.<verse eid="2KI 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Peka gwa Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 15:27" />Mshinja sha amusini na mbili sha ukolamlima wa mfalumi Uzia gwa Yuda, Peka mwana gwa Remalia kanjiti kukolamlima pakawera aku Samalia, kakolitimlima kwa shaka sha vinja ishilini. <verse eid="2KI 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 15:28" />Katendi makontola palongolu pa Mtuwa Mlungu kwa kufata mfanu mdoda gwa mfalumi Yeruboamu mwana gwa Nebati, yakawatenditi wantu wa Israeli watendi vidoda.<verse eid="2KI 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 15:29" />Shaka sha ukolamlima wa Peka mfalumi gwa Israeli, Tigalati Pileseri mfalumi gwa Ashuru, kayitoliti miji ya Iyoni na Abeli Betimaaka na Yanoa na Kadeshi na Hozari, pamuhera na isi za Gileadi na Galilaya na Nafutali na kuwatola lopola wenikaya wawu.<verse eid="2KI 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 15:30" />Mshinja sha ishilini sha ukolamlima wa Yotamu mwana gwa Uzia mfalumi gwa Yuda, Hoshea mwana gwa Ela kamgalambukiti Peka, mwana gwa Remalia na kumlaga, shakapanu kakolamlima pahala pakuyi. <verse eid="2KI 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 15:31" />Mirandu imonga ya Peka na goseri gakatenditi galembwa mu Shitabu sha Maholu ga Wafalumi wa Israeli.<verse eid="2KI 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Yotamu gwa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 27:1-9">2 Mirandu 27:1-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 15:32" />Mshinja sha pili sha ukolamlima wa Peka mwana gwa Remalia aku Israeli, Yotamu mwana gwa Uzia mfalumi gwa Yuda kanjiti kukolamlima Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 15:33" />Kaweriti na vinja ishilini na mhanu pakanjiti kukolamlima. Kakolitimlima aku Yerusalemu kwa shaka sha vinja kumi na sita. Mawu gwakuyi kashemitwi Yerusha, mhinga gwa Sadoki. <verse eid="2KI 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 15:34" />Handa Uzia tati gwakuyi, Yotamu katenditi mirandu yayimfiriziyiti Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2KI 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 15:35" />Ata hangu, pahala pa kuguwira wamlungu wampayu pahalibisiwitindiri na wantu waendireyiti kulaviya tambiku na kutumiziya ubani pahala pampindi. Yotamu kanyawa ligomi lya kushana lya Hekalu.<verse eid="2KI 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 15:36" />Mirandu imonga ya Yotamu na goseri gakatenditi galembwa mu Shitabu sha Maholu ga Wafalumi wa Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 15:37" />Shaka sha ukolamlima wa Yotamu, Mtuwa Mlungu kanjiti kumtuma mfalumi Resini gwa Aramu na mfalumi Peka gwa Israeli su kuyikomanga Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2KI 15:38" />Yotamu kahowiti na kufindirwa mumasembi ga shifalumi mumji gwa Dawudi na mwana gwakuyi Ahazi kakolitimlima pahala pakuyi.<verse eid="2KI 15:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2KI 16" />
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Ahazi gwa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 28:1-27">2 Mirandu 28:1-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 16:1" />Mushinja sha lirongu na saba sha ukolamlima wa Peka mwana gwa Remaliya mfalumi gwa Israeli, Ahazi mwana gwa Yotamu mfalumi gwa Yuda kanjiti kukolamlima. <verse eid="2KI 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 16:2" />Ahazi Kaweriti na vinja ishilini pakanjiti kukolamlima. Kakolitimlima kwa shaka sha vinja lirongu na sita aku Yerusalemu. Katenda ndiri maheri kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu handa Dawudi mbuyi gwakuyi Ahazi ntambu yakatenditi, <verse eid="2KI 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 16:3" />kafatiti njira ya wafalumi wa Israeli. Nentu ya aga, ata kamlaviyiti mwana gwakuyi kaweri tambiku ya kulunguziya tolosu kwa shinyagu, pakafata njira idoda ya wantu wa maisi gamonga yagawingwitwi na Mtuwa Mlungu gwa Israeli pawaweriti wankwingira muisi ayi ya Kanani. <verse eid="2KI 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 16:4" />Ahazi kalaviyiti tambiku na kutumiziya ubani pahala pampindi, pavigongu na pasi pa kila mtera mkulu gwana lisisi.<verse eid="2KI 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 16:5" />Shakapanu Resini mfalumi gwa Aramu na Peka mwana gwa Remalia mfalumi gwa Israeli walawiliti su kulikomanga nkondu na Yerusalemu na womberi wamzyengeta Ahazi, kumbiti waweza ndiri kumkanka. <verse eid="2KI 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 16:6" />Shaka ashi, mfalumi gwa Aramu kagulopoliti mji gwa Elati kawawuzilira Waaramu na kuwawinga wantu wa Yuda yawalikaliti amu. Na Waaramu wingira Elati na kulikala aku mpaka vinu. <verse eid="2KI 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 16:7" />Su Ahazi kalagalira wantu kwa mfalumi Tigilati Pileseri gwa Ashuru pawawera na ulagilagi awu. “Neni ndo ntumintumi gwaku mwaminika. Gwizi gunopoli kulawa kwa wafalumi wa Aramu na Israeli weni wankungomanga.” <verse eid="2KI 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 16:8" />Ahazia katola madini ga feza na zahabu yaviweriti mu Hekalu na luhanja lwaluweriti munumba ya mfalumi na kumjegera handa lufupu mfalumi gwa Ashuru. <verse eid="2KI 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 16:9" />Tigalati Pileseri, kitikiriti luwa ya Ahazi, kagukomangiti mji gwa Damasiko na kugulopola. Kamlaga mfalumi Resini na kuwajega malopola Kiri.<verse eid="2KI 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 16:10" />Mfalumi Ahazi pakasokiti Damasiko kuliwona na mfalumi Tigalati Pileseri, kawoniti shitalawanda aku. Su, kamjegeriti mtambika Uria mfanu gwa shitalawanda ashi na mpangu gwa kunyawa shitalawanda handa ashi pamuhera na matakuziya gakuki na unyawa awu. <verse eid="2KI 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 16:11" />Uria kanyawa shitalawanda ashi kulinganira na mfanu agu na kushimalira pamberi pa Ahazi kawuya ukaya. <verse eid="2KI 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 16:12" />Ahazi pakasokiti kulawa Damasiko, kashiwoniti shitalawanda ashi shipera kunyawiwa. <verse eid="2KI 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 16:13" />Kalaviya tambiku yakuyi ya kulunguziya tolosu ya viboga na ya virandu, kamishira mwazi gwa tambiku ya ponga. <verse eid="2KI 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 16:14" />Shitalawanda sha shaba sheni shilumikitwi kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, kashiwusiyiti kulongolu kwa numba kulawa lupeni lwakuyi pakati pa shitalawanda shakuyi na numba ya Mtuwa Mlungu, kashitula kulupenu lwaluwera uwega wa kushana mwa shitalawanda shakuyi. <verse eid="2KI 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 16:15" />Shakapanu kamlagalira Uria, “Gutenderi shitalawanda shangu ashi shikulu kwa kulunguziya tambiku za mandawira na tambiku za viboga za pamihi, tambiku za kulunguziwa za viboga za mfalumi mweni na tambiku za kunguziwa zyazilaviwa na wantu woseri na viraa tambiku za virandu za wantu. Gumishili mwazi gwa wankanyama woseri wa kulunguziwa weni walaviyitwi tambiku. Kumbiti shitalawanda shilii sha shaba hantendeli neni kwa kukosilira galii Mlungu kafira ntendi.” <verse eid="2KI 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 16:16" />Hangu Uria katenditi teratera handa mfalumi Ahazi ntambu yakamlagaliriti.<verse eid="2KI 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 16:17" />Mfalumi Ahazi kaziwusiya vikoleru yaviweriti zigoloziwa aku, kawusiya bilika yayishemitwi bahali yeni iweriti pampindi pa ng'ombi shipalu kumi na mbili wa shaba na kuyitula pampindi pa lyanjiru lya mabuwi. <verse eid="2KI 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 16:18" />Su kumfiriziya mfalumi gwa Ashuru Tigirasi Peresa mfalumi Ahazi kabomoliti liringu lya kuguwira lishaka lya kwoyera na kudiwa njira ya gweka yayiweriti yankutenderwa na wafalumi kwingira kunumba ya Mlungu.<verse eid="2KI 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 16:19" />Matendu gamonga goseri ga mfalumi Ahazi galembwa mu Shitabu sha maholu ga wafalumi wa Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 16:20" />Ahazi kahowa na kufindilwa mumasembi ga shifalumi mmuji gwa Dawudi na yomberi Hezekia kakolamlima pahala pakuyi.<verse eid="2KI 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2KI 17" />
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Hoshea gwa Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 17:1" />Mushinja sha kumi na mbili sha ukolamlima wa mfalumi Ahazi gwa Yuda, Hoshea mwana gwa Ela kanjiti kukolamlima Israeli, kakolamlima pakawera aku Samaria kwa vinja tisa. <verse eid="2KI 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 17:2" />Katenditi vidoda kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu tembera handa ndiri wafalumi wa Israeli yawamlongoleriti. <verse eid="2KI 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 17:3" />Mfalumi Shalimanesa gwa Ashuru kizi kulikomanga nayu nkondu na yomberi Hoshea kajimira kusinda na kaweriti ntumintumi gwakuyi na kumlipa kodi mukila shinja. <verse eid="2KI 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 17:4" />Shinja shimu mfalumi Shalimanesa gwa Ashuli kayambuliti handa mfalumi Hoshea kamgalambuka toziya katuma ulagilagi kwa mfalumi Soo gwa Misri. Aku mfalumi pakawera kaleka kulipa koda yakuyi ya kila shinja kwa mfalumi gwa Ashuru shakapanu Shalimanesa kambata na kumtatira mushibetubetu.<verse eid="2KI 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukankwa kwa Samalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 17:5" />Mfalumi gwa Ashuru kayikangala isi yoseri na kusoka mji gwa Samalia na kuguzyengeta kwa shaka sha vinja vitatu. <verse eid="2KI 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 17:6" />Mushinja sha tisa sha ukolamlima wa Hoshea, mfalumi gwa Ashuru kayilopoliti Samalia na kuwatola wantu wa Israeli malopola mpaka Ashuru, wamonga wawu kawatula walikali kumji gwa Hala, wamonga mji gwa Gozani pakwegera na lushemba Habori na wamonga mumiji ya Media.<verse eid="2KI 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 17:7" />Goseri aga gatendikiti toziya wantu wa Israeli wamgalambukiti Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwawu, mweni kawalaviyiti kulawa mmawoku ga mfalumi gwa Misri, viraa wawaguwiriti wamlungu wamonga, <verse eid="2KI 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 17:8" />na kufata njira za wantu wa isi zimonga zyeni Mtuwa Mlungu kawawingiti palongolu pa Waisraeli na kutenda matendu yagayingiziwitwi muisi na wafalumi wa Israeli. <verse eid="2KI 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 17:9" />Wantu wa Israeli watenditi kwa bada mirandu yayiweritindiri miheri palongolu pa Mlungu, Mlungu gwawu. Wanyawiti pahala pampindi pavigongu vya kuguwira wamlungu wa mpayu mukila mji, kwanjira mji mdidini mpaka kumji gwana shibambaza. <verse eid="2KI 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 17:10" />Pampindi pa kila shigongu na pasi pa kila mtera mkulu gwana lisisi, wanyawiti mpanda za mabuwi na vinyagu vya mlungu gwa shidala Ashera, <verse eid="2KI 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 17:11" />na watumiziya ubani kuvitalawanda vyoseri vya wamlungu wa mpayu kufata ntambu wantu wa isi zimonga wawingitwi na Mtuwa Mlungu. Wamtenda Mtuwa Mlungu kakalali nentu na matendu gawu makontola, <verse eid="2KI 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 17:12" />na waguwira vinyagu vyeni Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti kawabera, pakalonga, “Namtenda hangu.”<verse eid="2KI 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 17:13" />Mtuwa Mlungu kawalagalira wambuyi na walola kuyikalipira Israeli na Yuda pakalonga, “Mzileki njira zyenu zidoda na pamjimira lagiru zyangu na malagalira gangu kulinganira na lagiru zyanawapananiti watati wenu na zyeni niwapananiti kupitira kwa wantumintumi waneni wambuyi.” <verse eid="2KI 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 17:14" />Kumbiti womberi wajimirandiri, waweriti wakamala gambira wambuyi wawu weni wamwaminindiri Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwawu. <verse eid="2KI 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 17:15" />Walemiti kujimira malagalira gakuyi, walikolandiri lipatanu lyakatenditi na watati wawu na kulema makalapiru gakuyi. Waviguwiriti vinyagu vyaviweritindiri na mana ata womberi waweritindiri na mana kayi, wafatiti shitiba sha wantu wa maisi yagawazyengekiti. Walema amuli za Mtuwa Mlungu pota kuzitenda.<verse eid="2KI 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 17:16" />Walemiti amuli zoseri za Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwawu, wanyawa shinyagu sha wamlungu wana wa ng'ombi wawili wadidini wa kuponda, viraa virii wanyawa shinyagu sha mlungu gwa shidala Ashera washiguwira na vintu vyoseri vya kuliyera viraa wamtendera Baali. <verse eid="2KI 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 17:17" />Wawalaviyiti wana wawu wapalu na wadala kuwera tambiku ya kulunguziya tolosu kwa wamlungu wawu wa mpayu, wagenda kwa walolera na wahawi. Wafiriti nentu kutenda makontola palongolu pa Mtuwa Mlungu, wamkalaliziya nentu. <verse eid="2KI 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 17:18" />Su Mtuwa Mlungu kawakalalira nentu wantu wa Israeli na kuwawinga nakamu kulawa muisi yakuyi, kamlekandiri muntu ila likabila lya Yuda gweka yakuyi.<verse eid="2KI 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 17:19" />Kumbiti ata wantu wa Yuda wajimirandiri lagiru la Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwawu, su wafata njira za wantu wa Israeli. <verse eid="2KI 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 17:20" />Mtuwa Mlungu kawalemiti Waisraeli woseri na Wayuda woseri, kawakomanga na kuwaleka mmawoku mwa wankondu wakalipa na shakapanu kawawinga palongolu pakuyi.<verse eid="2KI 17:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 17:21" />Pa Mtuwa Mlungu kuwatula gweka wantu wa Israeli na lukolu lwa Dawudi, wantu wa Israeli wamlumika Yeruboamu mwana gwa Nebali kuwera mfalumi. Na Yeruboamu kawatenda wantu wa Israeli kumleka Mtuwa Mlungu na kutenda vidoda vikulu nentu. <verse eid="2KI 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 17:22" />Waisraeli watenditi vidoda vyakatenditi Yeruboamu, wasinditi kuvileka, <verse eid="2KI 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 17:23" />Upeleru Mtuwa Mlungu kawawinga kulawa palongolu pakuyi, ntambu yakaweriti kawaberiziya kupitira kwa wantumintumi wakuyi woseri wambuyi. Hangu wantu wa Waisraeli watolitwi lopola kulawa isi yawu weni wajegwa mpaka Ashuru kweni walikala mpaka vinu.<verse eid="2KI 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Washuru wanyawa kaya zawu Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 17:24" />Shakapanu mfalumi gwa Ashuru kawatola wantu kulawa Babeli na Kutha na Ava na Hamati na Sefarivaimu na kuwatula mumiji ya Samalia pahala pa wantu wa Israeli wawajegitwi muuhamisiya. Wayitola miji ayi na kulikala amu. <verse eid="2KI 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 17:25" />Pawanjiti kulikala amu, wamguwirandiri Mtuwa Mlungu, hangu Mtuwa Mlungu kalagalira simba muwamu mwawu na womberi walaguwa na simba ayu. <verse eid="2KI 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 17:26" />Shakapanu wantu wamgambira mfalumi gwa Ashuru, “Wantu wa isi zimonga yaguwatoliti na kuwatula mumiji ya Samalia wavimanandiri mirandu yakafira Mlungu gwa isi ayi, hangu Mlungu ayu katumiti simba mweni wankuwalaga.” <verse eid="2KI 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 17:27" />Mfalumi gwa Ashuru kalonga, “Mwuziyi mtambika yumu pakati pa walii yatuwajegiti lopola, mumuwuziyi kagendi na kulikala aku, su kawafundi wantu lagiru ya Mlungu gwa isi ayi.” <verse eid="2KI 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 17:28" />Hangu yumu gwa watambika yawalopolitwi kulawa Samalia kagenditi na kulikala Beteli na aku kawafunda wantu ntambu ya kumguwira Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="2KI 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 17:29" />Kumbiti wantu woseri yawalikaliti mumiji ya Samalia walinyawiliti wamlungu wawu na kuyitula pahala pakuguwira papanyawitwi na Waisraeli. <verse eid="2KI 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 17:30" />Wantu kulawa Babeli wanyawa vinyagu vya mlungu Sukoti Benoti na wantu kulawa Kuti wanyawa vinyagu vya mlungu Nerigali, wantu wa Hamati wanyawa vinyagu vya mlungu Ashima, <verse eid="2KI 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 17:31" />Wantu kulawa Iva wanyawiti vinyagu vya wamlungu Nibihazi na Taritaki na Wasefarivaimu walaviyiti wana wawu kuwera tambiku ya kulunguziwa tolosu kwa wamlungu wawu Adrameleki na Anameleki. <verse eid="2KI 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 17:32" />Wantu awa viraa wamguwiriti Mtuwa Mlungu. Wasyagula kulawa pakati pawu wantu wa kila ntambu na kuwatenda watambika kutenderwa pahala pakuguwira na kulaviya tambiku aku toziya yawu. <verse eid="2KI 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 17:33" />Hangu wamguwiriti Mtuwa Mlungu, kumbiti shaka shiraashi waguwiriti viraa wamlungu wawu yawayitoliti kulawa isi yawu.<verse eid="2KI 17:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 17:34" />Ata vinu wankutenda ntambu yawatenditi mashaka gapititi. Wamguwira ndiri ntambu yayifiruwa Mlungu, pota kufata malagalira ama lagiru zyeni Mtuwa Mlungu kawagambiriti wana wa Yakobu, mweni kampananiti Yakobu litawu lya Israeli. <verse eid="2KI 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 17:35" />Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti katenda lipatanu na wantu wa Israeli na kuwagambira, “Namguwira wamlungu wamonga, namuwasundamalira, namwitendera pota namwitambikira. <verse eid="2KI 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 17:36" />Hamung'uwiri neni Mtuwa Mlungu, yaniwalaviyiti aku Misri kwa uwezu na likakala livuwa. Hamnsuntamaliri neni na kundavilira tambiku. <verse eid="2KI 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 17:37" />Shaka shoseri hamfati shaniwagambira, malongoziya na lagiru zyeni nembiti toziya ya mwenga, mashaka goseri hamtendi weri. Namuwaguwira kayi wamlungu wamonga, <verse eid="2KI 17:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2KI 17:38" />pota namlwaluwa lipatanu lyandenditi na mwenga, namuwaguwira wamlungu wamonga, <verse eid="2KI 17:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2KI 17:39" />ila hamnguwiri neni Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu, naneni haniwalopoli kulawa mumawoku ga wankondu wenu.” <verse eid="2KI 17:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="2KI 17:40" />Kumbiti wantu awa wapikanirandiri, su wendeleyiti kutenda ntambu yawatenditi mashaka gapititi.<verse eid="2KI 17:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2KI 17:41" />Su wantu wa isi ayi wamguwiliti Mtuwa Mlungu, kumbiti viraa washiguwiriti shinyagu shawu. Mpaka vinu, walelwa wawu wendeleya kutenda ntambu yawatenditi wambuyi wawu.<verse eid="2KI 17:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2KI 18" />
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Hezekia gwa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 29:1-2">2 Mirandu 29:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="2CH 31:1">31:1</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 18:1" />Mushinja sha tatu sha ukolamlima wa Hoshea mwana gwa Ela, pakawera mfalumi gwa Israeli, Hezekia mwana gwa Ahazi mfalumi gwa Yuda kanjiti kukolamlima. <verse eid="2KI 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 18:2" />Hezekia kaweriti na vinja ishilini na mhanu kanjiti kukolamlima. Kakolitimlima vinja ishilini na tisa aku Yerusalemu. Mawu gwakuyi kaweriti Abiya, mhinga gwa Zakalia. <verse eid="2KI 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 18:3" />Hezekia katenditi maheri palongolu pa Mtuwa Mlungu, ntambu yakatenditi Dawudi mbuyi gwakuyi. <verse eid="2KI 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 18:4" />Kapawusiya pahala poseri pa kuguwira wamlungu wa mpayu na kuzipantanga mpanda za mabuyi za kutambikira na za mlungu Ashera. Viraa, kampantaga njoka gwa shaba mweni Musa kamnyawiti na kumshema Nehushitani. Mpaka shaka ashi, wantu wa Israeli waweriti wankushitambikira. <verse eid="2KI 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 18:5" />Hezekia Kamtumbiriti Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli, kwahera yakaweriti handa yomberi pakati pa wafalumi wa Yuda yawafatiti ama yawamlongoleriti. <verse eid="2KI 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 18:6" />Yomberi kamgalambukandiri Mtuwa Mlungu pota kalekandiri kumfata, su kazikola lagiru za Mtuwa Mlungu zyakawapananiti wantu wa Israeli kupitira Musa. <verse eid="2KI 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 18:7" />Su Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti pamuhera na yomberi na kamtenditi kila shakatenditi. Na mfalumi kamtenda kamgalambukira mfalumi gwa Ashuru na kulema kumtendera. <verse eid="2KI 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 18:8" />Kawakomangiti Wafilisiti mpaka lushi lwa Gaza na isi yayizyengetitwi, kwanjira shindwaringu sha walolera mpaka mji gwana liboma.<verse eid="2KI 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 18:9" />Mushinja sha msheshi sha ufalumi wa Hezekia, sheni viraa shiweriti shinja sha saba sha ufalumi wa Hoshea mwana gwa Ela mfalumi gwa Israeli, Shalimanesa mfalumi gwa Ashuru kagukomangiti mji gwa Samaria na kuguzyengeta kwa mashonta. <verse eid="2KI 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 18:10" />Mushinja sha tatu Waashuru wawakankiti wantu kulawa Samalia. Iweriti mushinja sha sita wa ufalumi wa Hezekia na viraa shinja sha tisa sha ufalumi wa Hoshea mfalumi gwa Israeli, Samalia ilopolitwi. <verse eid="2KI 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 18:11" />Mfalumi gwa Ashuru kawatoliti lopola wantu wa Israeli mpaka Ashuru na kuwatula wamonga wawu mumji gwa Hala wamonga mumji gwa Habori wamonga kumji gwa Gozani, viraa na wamonga kumji gwa Media.<verse eid="2KI 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 18:12" />Aga galawira toziya Waisraeli wajimirandiri liziwu lya Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwawu, kumbiti walemiti lipatanu lyakuyi, ata wapikanirandiri pota kujimira goseri Musa ntumintumi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu, ntambu yakawagambiriti.<verse eid="2KI 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalumi gwa Ashuru kankumtishira mfalumi gwa Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 32:1-19">2 Mirandu 32:1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 36:1-22">Isaya 36:1-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 18:13" />Mushinja sha kumi na nne sha ufalumi wa Ezekia, mfalumi Senakeribu gwa Ashuru kayikomangiti miji yoseri yana maboma ga Yuda na kuyilopola. <verse eid="2KI 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 18:14" />Ezekia kalagaliriti ulagilagi kwa mfalumi Senakeribu yakawera aku Lakishi na mfalumi Ezekia kamgambira, “Ndenda likosa, shondi, gumaliri makomangu gaku kwaneni, naneni handipi shoseri shagufira.” Mfalumi gwa Ashuru kamlagalira Hezekia kamjegeri tani lirongu za mpiya na tani yimu za zahabu. <verse eid="2KI 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 18:15" />Hezekia kamjegera feza zoseri zyaziweriti mu Hekalu na muhanja za numba ya mfalumi. <verse eid="2KI 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 18:16" />Ntambu iraa, kabandula zahabu kulawa mumigomi ya Hekalu na zahabu yeni mweni kayituliti mumpanda ya migomi yoseri kamjegera Senakeribu. <verse eid="2KI 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 18:17" />Mfalumi gwa Ashuru kalagalira lishonta likulu palilongoziwa na wakulu wa mashonta watatu kulawa Lakishi kugenda kwa mfalumi Hezekia aku Yerusalemu. Wasoka Yerusalemu na kugoloka pakwegera na lushemba lwa lwaluweriti uwega wa pampindi munjira nkulu yayigenda lulalanda lwa Waputa nguwu. <verse eid="2KI 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 18:18" />Shakapanu wamshema mfalumi Hezekia kawankitwi na Eliakimu mwana gwa Hilikia, ndo yakaweriti mgolokera gwa liboma na Shebina, yakaweriti mlemba na Yoa mwana gwa Asafu, mlemba gwa maholu ga mfalumi. <verse eid="2KI 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 18:19" />Mkulu gwa mashonta wa Ashuru kawagambira, “Mmugambiri Hezekia, hangu ndo ntambu yakalonga mfalumi mkulu, mfalumi gwa Ashuru, mmukosiyi Hezekia shakalitumbira shishi? <verse eid="2KI 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 18:20" />Hashi, gulihola kuwera visoweru hera ndo viweza kukanka kunkondu? Gumtumbira gaa mpaka gung'alambuka? <verse eid="2KI 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 18:21" />Vinu guloli, gulitumbira Misri kukutanga, ndo handa kulutumbira luteti kuwela luhonga lya kutyangira halumegeki na kukutenda muliwoku. Hangu ndo ntambu ya kumtumbira Falawu mfalumi gwa Misri ntambu yakawera kwa woseri walii yawamtumbira.”<verse eid="2KI 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 18:22" />“Kendereya kulonga handa pamung'ambira, twankumtumbira Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwetu, Muvimani handa Hezekia ulaayu mweni kapahalibisiya pahala pampindi na shitalawanda sha Mlungu na kuwagambira wantu wa Yuda na wantu wa Yerusalemu waguwiri hera palongolu pashitalawanda shashiwera mu Yerusalemu? <verse eid="2KI 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 18:23" />Vinu mwizi, mtendi majimiranu na mtuwa gwangu mfalumi gwa Ashuru, neni haniwapanani farasi elufi mbili handa pamuweza kupata wakwena farasi. <verse eid="2KI 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 18:24" />Gwenga na lishonta laku didini haguwezi hashi kulewelera yumu gwa mkulu gwa lishonta lididini na lyahera makakala la mtuwa gwangu, tembera gutumbira Misri kwa mbutuka za nkondu na wakwena farasi?” <verse eid="2KI 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 18:25" />Nentu ya aga, hashi, mlihola niza pota amuli ya Mtuwa Mlungu su kuyikomanga na kuyihalibisiya isi ayi? Mtuwa Mlungu ndo yakang'ambiriti, “Guyikomangi isi ayi na kuyihalibisiya.”<verse eid="2KI 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 18:26" />Su, Eliakimu mwana wa Hilikia na Shebina na Yoa wamgambira mkuulu gwa lishonta ayu, “Shondi, gutakuli natwenga kwa Shiaramu, toziya tuyimana, nagutakula na twenga kwa Shiebrania, toziya wantu yawawera mshibambaza wankupikanira.”<verse eid="2KI 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 18:27" />Kumbiti mkulu gwa mashonta kawagambira, “Hashi, mtuwa gwangu kandagalira kulaviya ulagilagi awu kwa mtuwa gwenu na kwa mwenga hera? Hashi, kantumandiri viraa kwa wantu yawalikala mshibambaza sheni watozwa pamuhera na mwenga haniwatimbi mpaka vyamunumba vilawi.”<verse eid="2KI 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 18:28" />Shakapanu mkulu gwa lishonta ayu kagoloka, kabota na kulonga kwa luga ya Shiebrania, “Mpikiniri visoweru vya mfalumi mkulu, mfalumi gwa Ashuru vyakawagambira! <verse eid="2KI 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 18:29" />Hangu ndo ntambu yakalonga mfalumi, namjimira Hezekia kawapayiri, toziya hapeni kawezi kuwalopola. <verse eid="2KI 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 18:30" />Namjimira kuzyangwa su mumtumbiri Mtuwa Mlungu, pakalonga, Mtuwa Mlungu hakatulopoli na mji agu hapeni gutulwi mumawoku mwa mfalumi gwa Ashuru. <verse eid="2KI 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 18:31" />Nammupikinira Hezekia, ira mumpikaniri mfalumi gwa Ashuru yakalonga, mjimiri kukolwamlima yomberi, su hakawalekeziyi mwenga muwezi kuliya mabwajubwaju ga mazabibu gakuyi mweni na mabwajubwaju ga mtera gwakuyi mweni na kulanda mashi ga linegu lyakuyi mweni, <verse eid="2KI 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 18:32" />mpaka panizaku na kuwajegera kutali muisi handa ayi ya mwenga, isi yeni yana viboga na divai na isi yana malambu ga nganu yagalaviya mabumunda na isi yana mizeituni na lwashi, su mpati kulikala, namwiza kuhowa. Nammupikanira Hezekia pakawatanda pakalonga, Mtuwa Mlungu hakatulopoli. <verse eid="2KI 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 18:33" />Hashi, kwana yoseri pakati pa wamlungu wa wantu yakalopoliti isi yakuyi kulawa mumawoku mwa mfalumi gwa Ashuru? <verse eid="2KI 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 18:34" />Hashi, wakoshi wamlungu wa Hamati na Aripadi. Wakoshi wamlungu wa Sefarivaimu, Hena na Iva? Hashi, ilopola Samalia mumawoku mwaneni? <verse eid="2KI 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 18:35" />Ndo wamlungu gaa muwamu mwa isi azi yakalopoliti isi zawu kulawa kwaneni? Ntambu gaa Mtuwa Mlungu kaweza kugulopola mji gwa Yerusalemu kulawa kwaneni?”<verse eid="2KI 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 18:36" />Kumbiti wantu woseri wanyamaliti jii, pota kumwankula shisoweru, ntambu yakagambiritwi na mfalumi Hezekia, pakalonga, “Namumwankula.” <verse eid="2KI 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 18:37" />Shakapanu Eliakimu mwana wa Elikia, Shebina mlemba na Yoa mwana gwa Asafu, mlemba, wamgendera Hezekia aku nguwu zawu paziweri zidegekanga, wamgambira visoweru vya mkulu gwa mashonta ulii.<verse eid="2KI 18:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2KI 19" />
  <para style="s">Hezekia kankuluwautanga kwa Isaya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ISA 37:1-7">Isaya 37:1-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 19:1" />Mfalumi Hezekia pakapikaniriti visoweru avi, kapapula nguwu yakuyi, kavala lifafa kingira mu Hekalu. <verse eid="2KI 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 19:2" />Kawalagalira Eliyakimu mkulu gwa liboma, Shebina yakaweriti mlemba gwakuyi na wazewi wa watambika, wamgenderi mbuyi Isaya mwana gwa Amozi, pawawera wavala nguwu za mafafa. <verse eid="2KI 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 19:3" />Na womberi wamgambira Isaya, Hezekia kalonga hangu, “Leru ndo lishaka lya kwinginika, lishaka lya kubeliziwa na lya kusoniziwa. Twenga tuwera gambira mawu yakafira kulera mwana, kumbiti kahera makakala ga kumlera. <verse eid="2KI 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 19:4" />Hangu Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwaku kapikaniriti visoweru vya mkulu gwa mashonta, mweni kalagalilwa na mfalumi gwa Ashuru, mtuwa gwakuyi, su kumwigira Mlungu yakawera mkomu na yomberi ndo Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwaku, hakakalipili visoweru vyakapikaniriti, hangu muwaluwi wantu yawasigaliti.”<verse eid="2KI 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 19:5" />Su, wantumintumi awa wa mfalumi Hezekia pawasokiti kwa Isaya na pawamgambiriti kala, <verse eid="2KI 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 19:6" />su yomberi kawagambiriti, “Mmugambiri mtuwa gwenu handa, Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga hangu, nagutira toziya ya visoweru vyagupikaniriti, vyeni wantumintumi wa mfalumi gwa Ashuru wavitakula kwa kunjongera. <verse eid="2KI 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 19:7" />Guloli hanimtendi mfalumi kapikaniri visoweru vyanavimtendi kawuyi ukaya kwakuyi, shakapanu aku hanimtendi kalaguwi kwa ligumba.”<verse eid="2KI 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lyoga limonga lya Waashuru</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ISA 37:8-20">Isaya 37:8-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 19:8" />Shakapanu mkulu gwa lishonta ulii pakapikiniliti handa mfalumi gwa Ashuru kaweriti kawuka Lakishi. Kawukiti na kumwona pakagukomanga mji gwa Libina. <verse eid="2KI 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 19:9" />“Shakapanu mfalumi pakapikaniriti handa Tirihaka mfalumi gwa Kushi, kakwiza kulikomanga na yomberi, katumiti walagilagi kwa Hezekia, pakalonga,” <verse eid="2KI 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 19:10" />“Mmugambiri Hezekia mfalumi gwa Yuda, nagumjimira Mlungu gwaku yagumtumbira kakupayiri kwa kukugambira handa mji gwa Yerusalemu hapeni gulopolwi na mfalumi gwa Ashuru. <verse eid="2KI 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 19:11" />Gwenga gupikanira kala handa wafalumi wa Ashuru ntambu yawazitenditi isi zimonga na kuzihalibisiya nakamu. Hashi, gulihola gwenga haguponeki? <verse eid="2KI 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 19:12" />Hashi, wamlungu wa wantu yawawera Gozani na Harani na Resefu na Waedeni yawalikaliti Telasari, wantu weni wambuyi waneni wawagamiziyiti? <verse eid="2KI 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 19:13" />Wakoshi wafalumi wa Hamati na Aripadi na Sefarivaimu na Hena na wa Iva?”<verse eid="2KI 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 19:14" />Mfalumi Hezekia kankiti luwamba kulawa kwa walagilagi na kulubetula. Shakapanu kagenda na kwingira mu Hekalu na yomberi kalutula palongolu pa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2KI 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 19:15" />Shakapanu kamluwa Mtuwa Mlungu pakalonga, “Gwee Mlungu, Mlungu wa Israeli, yagulikala mushiti cha shifalumi pakati pa makerubi, ndo gwenga hera yaguwera Mlungu, yagukolamlima falumi zoseri za pasipanu. Gwenga gunyawiti isi na mpindi. <verse eid="2KI 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 19:16" />Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, gugubatuli masu gaku guloli, guyambiki likutu lyaku, gupikanili visoweru vya Senakeribu kakwigira gwenga Mlungu yaguweri mkomu. <verse eid="2KI 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 19:17" />Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, tuvimana handa wafalumi wa Ashuru wahowiziya wantu na isi zawu. <verse eid="2KI 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 19:18" />Wasa wamlungu wawu mumotu toziya waweritindiri wamlungu wa nakaka, ila vinyagu vya mitera na mabuwi yavisongolitwi na mawoku ga wantu. <verse eid="2KI 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 19:19" />Vinu, gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa twenga, nikuluwa gutulopoli kulawa kwa Senakeribu, wafalumi woseri wa pasi panu wavimani handa ndo gwenga gweka yaku, gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, yaguwera Mlungu.”<verse eid="2KI 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulagilagi wa Isaya kwa mfalumi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ISA 37:21-38">Isaya 37:21-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 19:20" />“Shakapanu Isaya mwana gwa Amozi katuma ulagilagi kwa mfalumi Hezekia, pakalonga, hangu ndo ntambu yakalonga Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu wa Israeli, mpikinira luwa yaku kwaneni toziya ya Senakeribu mfalumi gwa Ashuru.” <verse eid="2KI 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 19:21" />Shisoweru sha Mtuwa Mlungu shilonga hangu, “Mji gwa Yerusalemu gukuseka gwenga na Senakerubi kankukujongera gwenga. <verse eid="2KI 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 19:22" />Gaa, yagumtendera lidufiya na kumjongera? Gaa yagumbotera na kumlola dii? Pampindi pa mnanagala gwa Israeli! <verse eid="2KI 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 19:23" />Kwakuwalagalira walagilagi waku gumwigira Mtuwa Mlungu na gutakula, nana mbutuka zivuwa za nkondu, nkwena mpeleru zya vigongu mpaka upeleru wa Lebanoni. Ndumula mierezi yakuyi mitali na misonubali ihelepa ningira mpaka mngati mwakuyi na mngati mwa shitogolu shakuyi shikulu. <verse eid="2KI 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 19:24" />Mbawa manegu na kulanda mashi gashihenga yumiziyiti nshemba zoseri za Misri kwa nzayu za magulu gangu.”<verse eid="2KI 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 19:25" />“Vinu Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga, Hashi, hagwenipikaniri handa mpangiti shitwatira ashi kwanjira mashaka gapititi? Shantenditi vinu mpangiti makashu. Nikutuliti gunyawi miji yana maboma kwa limamatiru lya numba za makashu. <verse eid="2KI 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 19:26" />Wantu wakuyi waheriti makakala, watwezuka na kusoniziwa, wawera gambira vimeru vya mumalambu, handa mihamba mitekiteki. Handa vimeru vyavimera pampindi pa shitwiku, yaviyuma pamberi pa kukula”<verse eid="2KI 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 19:27" />“Nivimana kulivaga kwaku na kwimuka kwaku na kwingira kwaku na mipangu yaku toziya ya neni. <verse eid="2KI 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 19:28" />Toziya gutenda mipangu kuusu neni na mpikanira mtiti gwaku, hantuli ndowani yangu mumbula mwaku. Na shimpingapinga shaneni mulomu mwaku. Hanikuwuziyi njira iraili yagwiziliti.”<verse eid="2KI 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 19:29" />Shakapanu Isaya kamgambira mfalumi Hezekia, “Na ayi ndo hayiweli lilangaliru kwagwenga Hezekia. Shinja ashi na shinja shashiza hamliyi shashimera sheni pota kuyalwa. Kumbiti mushinja sha tatu hamyali na kubenanga viboga, hamyali mizabibu na kuliya mabwajubwaju gakuyi. <verse eid="2KI 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 19:30" />Walii wawafira kusigala mulukolu lwa Yuda hawongeleki na kuwera wavuwa handa mtera ntambu yagumera mumishigira yakuyi mlitapaka na kulera mabwajubwaju pampindi. <verse eid="2KI 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 19:31" />Mana hakuweri wantu yawasigala aku Yerusalemu na kulugongu Siyoni hakuweri wantu wavuwa ndiri wawaponeka, toziya Mlungu kafira kumalira aga”<verse eid="2KI 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 19:32" />“Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga hangu kuusu mfalumi gwa Waashuru. Hakingiri ndiri mji agu pota kuguguma msali ama kugwizira kwa lusegeyu na kuguzyengeta. <verse eid="2KI 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 19:33" />Hakawuyi kwa njira iraili yakiziriti na hapeni kingiri mji agu, ndo ntambu yakalonga Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2KI 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 19:34" />Yina, kwajili ya ligoya lyangu na toziya ya shilii shantakuliti kwa ntumintumi gwaneni Dawudi haniguloleli na kugulopola mji agu.”<verse eid="2KI 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 19:35" />Su, pashiru panu ntumintumi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu kingiriti kulugonjeru lwa Waashuru na kuwalaga wantu laki yimu na semanini na mhanu. Wantu pawimukiti, wawonikiti wahowiti kala. <verse eid="2KI 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 19:36" />Shakapanu Senakeribu mfalumi gwa Ashuru kawukiti kagenda zakuyi na kulikala Ninawi. <verse eid="2KI 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 19:37" />Lishaka limu shaka Senakeribu pakaweriti kankuguwira munumba ya Nisiroki mlungu gwakuyi, wanawakuyi wawili, Adirameleki na Sharezeri wamlagiti kwa ligumba, shakapanu watugira muisi ya Ararati. Na Esarihadoni, mwana gwakuyi kakolamlima pahala pakuyi.<verse eid="2KI 19:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2KI 20" />
  <para style="s">Kulwala na kupona kwa mfalumi Hezekia</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ISA 38:1-8">Isaya 38:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 32:24-26">2 Mirandu 32:24-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 20:1" />Shaka ashi Hezekia kalwaliti pakwegera na kuhowa. Mbuyi gwa Mlungu Isaya, mwana gwa Amozi kamgenderiti na kumgambira, “Hangu ndo ntambu yakalonga Mtuwa Mlungu, gutuli weri mirandu ya munumba yaku toziya haguhowi, hapeni guponi.”<verse eid="2KI 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 20:2" />Hezekia kagalambukira kushibambaza na kumluwa Mtuwa Mlungu pakalonga, <verse eid="2KI 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 20:3" />“Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, nikuluwa guholi ntambu yanikutendiriti kwa waminika na kwa moyu gwangu goseri na kutenda yagawera teratera kulongolu kwaku.” Hezekia kalira kwa utama nentu.<verse eid="2KI 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 20:4" />Kumbiti Isaya pamberi hakenipiti ligeleri lya pakati, Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira, <verse eid="2KI 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 20:5" />“Guwuyi gwakamgambiri Hezekia, mkulu gwa wantu wa Mtuwa Mlungu. Neni Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa tati gwaku Dawudi, mpikanira kuluwa kwaku na mona masozi gaku. Hangu hanikuponiziyi na pa mashaka matatu hagugendi Munumba ya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2KI 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 20:6" />Hanikongeleli vinja kumi na tano vya kulikala. Hanikulopoli gwenga na mji agu mumakakala ga mfalumi gwa Ashuru. Haniluloleli lushi alu toziya ya ligoya lyaneni na toziya ya shii shantakuliti kwa ntumintumi gwangu Dawudi.”<verse eid="2KI 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 20:7" />Shakapanu Isaya kalonga, “Mnyawi mgota gwa kumatika gwagulawirana na tini mlituli kulipu lyakuyi, su kaponi.” <verse eid="2KI 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 20:8" />Hezekia kamkosiya Isaya, “Ndo lilangaliru gaa halinanguziyi handa nakaka Mtuwa Mlungu hakamponiziyi na mulishaka lya tatu hambezi kugenda mu Hekalu?”<verse eid="2KI 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 20:9" />Isaya kamwankula, “Ali haliweri lilangaliru kwagwenga kulawa kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, handa Mtuwa Mlungu hakatendi ntambu yakalongiti. Hashi, lisisi lya kulikweneru ligendi maleka lirongu kulongolu ama liwuyi kumbeli maleka lilongu?”<verse eid="2KI 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 20:10" />Hezekia kamwankula, “Iwezekana lisisi kugenda kulongolu maleka lirongu! Kuliku kuwuya maleka lirongu.”<verse eid="2KI 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 20:11" />Isaya kamluwa Mtuwa Mlungu na yomberi Mtuwa Mlungu kalitenda lisisi maleka lirongu kulukwenelu lyalunyawitwi na Ahazi.<verse eid="2KI 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walagilagi kulawa Babeli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ISA 39:1-8">Isaya 39:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 20:12" />Shaka ashi, mfalumi Merodaki Baladani, mwana gwa Baladani mfalumi gwa Babeli kapikaniriti handa Hezekia kaweriti kalwala na vinu kapona, kamjegera ulagilagi pamuhera na lifupu. <verse eid="2KI 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 20:13" />Su, Hezekia kawankiti na kuwalanguziya lunda yakuyi. Numba yakuyi ya luhanja, madini ga feza na zahabu na utuli na viwungu vya kulekera mushiboga, lipaki lya beyi nkulu na numba ya vintu vyakuyi vyoseri vya shishonta na vintu vyoseri vyaviweriti muhanja zakuyi. Shiweritindiri shoseri muliboma lyakuyi, ama isi yakuyi sheni kawalanguziyandiri. <verse eid="2KI 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 20:14" />Shakapanu mbuyi gwa Mlungu Isaya pakamgendiriti mfalumi Hezekia na kumkosiya, “Wantu awa watakula shishi? Wiza kulawa koshi?” Na yomberi Hezekia kamwankula, “Wanizira kulawa isi ya kutali aku Babeli.”<verse eid="2KI 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 20:15" />Shakapanu kamkosiya, “Waona shishi muliboma lyaku?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 20:15">Hezekia kamwankula, “Waona vyoseri vyaviweriti muliboma lyangu. Kwahera shintu shoseri muhanja zyangu zyeni niwalanguziyitindiri.”<verse eid="2KI 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 20:16" />Shakapanu Isaya kamgambira Hezekia, “Gupikaniri shisoweru sha Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2KI 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 20:17" />Guloli, shaka shakwiza peni vyoseri yaviwera munumba mwaku na vintu vyoseri vyawajojoniriti wambuyi waku mpaka shaka ashi, havijegwi mpaka Babeli. Kwahera shintu shoseri hashisigali, hangu ndo ntambu yakalonga Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2KI 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 20:18" />Kayi wana waku wapalu hawalopolwi na womberi hawatendwi wasaulwa na kuwera wantumintumi muliboma lya mfalumi gwa Babeli.”<verse eid="2KI 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 20:19" />Hezekia kamgambira Isaya, “Shisoweru sha Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yagulongiti ndo teratera, hashi nayiwera hangu, mfalumi kalongiti hangu toziya kaliholiti hakuweri na ponga na ulolera mumashaka ga ukolamlima waneni”<verse eid="2KI 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Upeleru wa ukolamlima wa Hezekia</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 32:32-33">2 Mirandu 32:32-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 20:20" />Mirandu yimonga ya Mfalumi Hezekia, ugangamala wakuyi na matakulu kuusu ntambu yakanyawiti litanda na kubawa shishemba sha kujega mashi kumjini, galembwa mu Shitabu sha Mahola ga Wafalumi wa Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 20:21" />Hezekia kahowiti na mwana gwakuyi Manasi kakolamlima pahala pakuyi.<verse eid="2KI 20:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2KI 21" />
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Manase gwa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 33:1-20">2 Mirandu 33:1-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 21:1" />Manase kaweriti na vinja lirongu na mbili pakanjiti kukolamlima Yuda, kakolamlima kulawa Yerusalemu kwa shaka sha vinja amusini na mhanu. Litawu lya mawu wakuyi liweriti Hepiziba. <verse eid="2KI 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 21:2" />Manase katenditi madoda kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu kwa kujera migenderanu mikontola ya maisi geni gawingitwi na Mtuwa Mlungu shaka sha wantu wakuyi Waisraeli pawaweriti wankwingira muisi. <verse eid="2KI 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 21:3" />Toziya kanyawiti kayi pahala pa kuguwira wamlungu wamonga, papahalibisiyitwi na Hezekiya tati gwakuyi, kanyawa vitalawanda vya kuguwira Baali na kunyawa shinyagu sha Ashera, ntambu yakatenditi Ahabu mfalumi gwa Israeli. Manase kaguwiriti na kuvitendera vintu vyoseri vya kumpindi. <verse eid="2KI 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 21:4" />Kanyawiti vitalawanda vya kuwaguwira wamlungu mu Hekalu pahala peni Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti kalonga, “Hawanguwiri neni mu Yerusalemu.” <verse eid="2KI 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 21:5" />Mumiwaga miwili ya Hekalu kanyawiti shitalawanda sha kuguwira vintu vyaviwera kulyera. <verse eid="2KI 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 21:6" />Kamlaviya mwana gwakuyi kuwera tambiku ya kulunguziya. Katungiti na kupuguwa pakawera pamuhera na watunga na mahoka na wahawi. Katenditi makontola gavuwa kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu na kamkalaliziya. <verse eid="2KI 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 21:7" />Shinyagu sha Ashera shakanyawiti kashitula mu Hekalu lyeni Mtuwa Mlungu kayiyoweleriti palongolu pa Dawudi na mwana gwakuyi Selemani. “Munumba ayi ya Yerusalemu, yaniyisyaguliti ndo pahala pakunguwira mileri. <verse eid="2KI 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 21:8" />Handa Waisraeli hawajimiri kutenda goseri ganiwagambiriti na kufata lagiru lyoseri ntumintumi gwaneni Musa zyakawapananiti, su hapeni niwaleki wawingwi kulawa muisi ayi yeni niwapananiti wambuyi wawu.” <verse eid="2KI 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 21:9" />Kumbiti wapikinirandiri na Manase kawatenda watendi vidoda vikulu nentu kuliku virii vyavitenditwi na maisi geni Mtuwa Mlungu kagahalibisiyiti kulongolu kwa Waisraeli.<verse eid="2KI 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 21:10" />Mtuwa Mlungu kalongiti, kupitira kwa wantumintumi wakuyi wambuyi, <verse eid="2KI 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 21:11" />“Toziya Mfalumi Manase katenda mirandu ya kukalaziya, mirandu idoda nentu ya galii yagatenditwi na Waamori yawamlongoleriti, kawatenda wantu wa Yuda watendi viraa vidoda kwa kutendera vinyagu vyakuyi, <verse eid="2KI 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 21:12" />Su, vinu neni Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli, hanjegi mji gwa Yerusalemu na isi ya Yuda, shiwembu sheni ata yoseri yanakapikaniri hakasintuki. <verse eid="2KI 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 21:13" />Haniyikomangi Yerusalemu ntambu ilii yantenditi Samariya na ntambu yanimtenditi mfalumi Ahabu na wiwuka wakuyi. Haniyifuti Yerusalemu handa muntu ntambu yakafuta sahani yayigululitwi na kuseniziwa. <verse eid="2KI 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 21:14" />Haniwaleki wantu wangu yawasigaliti na haniwatendi wankondu wawu wawakomangi na kuwatola lopola na kupokwa isi yawu. <verse eid="2KI 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 21:15" />Haniwatendeli goseri aga toziya wang'alambuka na kunkalaliziya kwanjira wazewi wawu pawalawiti Misri mpaka leru.”<verse eid="2KI 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 21:16" />Nentu ya aga, paguleka vidoda vyakuyi, Manase kawatenditi wantu wa Yuda watendi vidoda palongolu pa Mtuwa Mlungu, vilavirii kawalagiti wantu wavuwa wahera likosa, mwazi gwawu gunyiririka kulawa uwega wumu wa mji mpaka uwega umonga wa mji gwa Yerusalemu.<verse eid="2KI 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 21:17" />Mirandu imonga ya Manase pamuhera na vidoda vyakuyi vyoseri, vilembwa mu Shitabu sha Maholu ga wafalumi wa Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 21:18" />Manase kahowiti na kufintilwa mushiwunga sha liboma lyakuyi, shinyawitwi na Uza. Na Amoni mwana gwakuyi kakolamlima pahala pakuyi.<verse eid="2KI 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Amoni gwa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 33:21-25">2 Mirandu 33:21-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 21:19" />Amoni kaweriti na vinja ishilini na mbili pakanjiti kukolamlima, kakolitimlima vinja viwili aku Yerusalemu. Mawu gwakuyi kashemitwi Meshulemeti, mhinga Haruzi kulawa Yotiba. <verse eid="2KI 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 21:20" />Katenditi makontola kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, ntambu yakatenditi Manase tati gwakuyi. <verse eid="2KI 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 21:21" />Kafatiti njira yoseri yakayigendiriti tati gwakuyi na kuvitendera vinyagu vyeni tati gwakuyi kavitendiriti na kuviguwira. <verse eid="2KI 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 21:22" />Kamlemiti kujimira malagaliru ga Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa wambuyi wakuyi.<verse eid="2KI 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 21:23" />Shakapanu wantumintumi wa Amoni watenditi mpangu gwa kumlaga Amoni muliboma lyakuyi. <verse eid="2KI 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 21:24" />Kumbiti wantu wa Yuda wawalaga wantu woseri yawamlagiti Amoni. Shakapanu wamlumika Yosia mwana gwakuyi pahala pakuyi.<verse eid="2KI 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 21:25" />Mirandu yoseri ya Amoni ilembwa mu Shitabu sha Maholu ga Wafalumi wa Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 21:26" />Amoni kafintirwa mulisembi lyaliweriti mushiwunga sha Uza, shakapanu Yosia mwana gwakuyi kakolitimlima pahala pakuyi.<verse eid="2KI 21:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2KI 22" />
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Yosia gwa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 34:1-2">2 Mirandu 34:1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 22:1" />Yosia kaweriti na vinja vinani pakanjiti kuwera mkolamlima aku Yerusalemu, kakolamlima kwa vinja selasini na yimu. Mawu gwakuyi kaweriti Yedida, mhinga gwa Adaya, kulawa mji gwa Bosikati. <verse eid="2KI 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 22:2" />Yosia katenditi maheri na kamfiriziyiti Mtuwa Mlungu. Kafatiti mfanu gwa mfalumi Dawudi yakamlongoliriti na kuzifata kwa waminika lagiru za Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="2KI 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shitabu cha Lagiru shiyambulwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 34:8-28">2 Mirandu 34:8-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 22:3" />Mushinja sha lirongu nanani sha ukolamlima wakuyi, Mfalumi kamtumiti mlemba Shafani, mwana gwa Azalia, mzukulu gwa Meshulamu, mu Hekalu la Mtuwa Mlungu pakalonga, <verse eid="2KI 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 22:4" />“Gugendi kwa mtambika mkulu Hilikia gumgambili kawalangi mpiya zirii zyazijegitwi mu Hekalu, zyeni walolera wazijojoniriti kulawa kwa wantu. <verse eid="2KI 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 22:5" />Shiyashi sha mpiya azi zipananwi wagolokera wa manyawa ga Hekalu, su wawalipi wanyawa yawatenda manyawa, <verse eid="2KI 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 22:6" />weni ndo wasongola mbawu, wanyawa na watenda lihengu wamonga. Zimonga zitenderwi kuhemera mbawu na mabuwi yagasongolitwi toziya ya kutendera kwa syayi manyawa ga numba. <verse eid="2KI 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 22:7" />Wantu yawagolokera unyawa nawafiruwa kulaviya walanga ya matendera ga mpiya zyawapanananwa, toziya wazitendera kwa waminika.”<verse eid="2KI 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 22:8" />Shakapanu mtambika mkulu Hilikia kamgambiriti mlemba Shafani, “Nishipata shitabu sha Lagiru mu Hekalu.” Hilikia kampanana shitabu Shafani na yomberi kashibetula. <verse eid="2KI 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 22:9" />Mlemba Shafani, kamgendera mfalumi na kulaviya shisoweru, pakalonga, “Wantumintumi waku walaviya senti zyazipatikaniti mu Hekalu shakapanu wawapanana wanyawa yawagolokera manyawa syayi ga numba ya Mtuwa Mlungu.” <verse eid="2KI 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 22:10" />Shakapanu mlemba Shafani, kawagambira mfalumi, “Hilikia kampanana shitabu.” Na Shafani kashibetula palongolu pa mfalumi.<verse eid="2KI 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 22:11" />Mfalumi pakapikaniriti yagalembitwi mu Shitabu sha Lagiru, kapapuliti nguwu zakuyi, <verse eid="2KI 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 22:12" />nakawalagalira mtambika Hilikia, Ahikamu mwana gwa Shafani na Akibori mwana gwa Mikaya pamuhera na mlemba Shafani na Asaya ntumintumi gwa mfalumi, pakalonga, <verse eid="2KI 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 22:13" />“Mgendi mwakasakuli shakutenda kulawa kwa Mtuwa Mlungu kwajili yaneni na wantu wa Yuda woseri kuusu vyoseri vyavilembitwi mu shitabu ashi shashiwonikiti. Mtuwa Mlungu katukalalira, mana wambuyi watwenga wajimirandiri yagalembitwi mu shitabu ashi na kutenda vyoseri vyavilembitwi kwajili yatwenga.”<verse eid="2KI 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 22:14" />Hangu mtambika Hilikia na Ahikamu na Akibori na Shafani na Asaya, woseri wagenditi kwa mawu yumu mbuyi litawu lyakuyi Hulida kaweriti mdala gwa Shalumu yakaweriti mtula nguwu za Hekalu. Na ayu Shalumu kaweriti mwana gwa Tikiva na Tikiva mwana gwa Harihasi. Shaka ashi Hulida kaweriti kankulikala mumtaa gwa pili gwa Yerusalemu na womberi wayowera nayu. <verse eid="2KI 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 22:15" />“Su kawagambira Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli kalonga, mmugambiri ayu yakawalagaliliti kwaneni,” <verse eid="2KI 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 22:16" />Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga hangu, “Hanjegi makontola toziya ya pahala panu na kwajili ya wenikaya wakuyi ntambu yayiwera mushitabu shashibetulitwi na mfalumi gwa Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 22:17" />Toziya wandeka na kuwatumiziya ubani wamlungu wamonga na hangu kunkalaziya kwa lihengu lyoseri lya mawoku gawu, maya gangu kwa Yerusalemu hagakalipi na hapeni ganyamaziwi. <verse eid="2KI 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 22:18" />Kumbiti mfalumi gwa Yuda yakawalagaliriti kusakula utakulu wa Mtuwa Mlungu, mmugambiri handa, hangu ndo ntambu yakalongiti Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli, kuusu visoweru vyagupikaniriti, <verse eid="2KI 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 22:19" />toziya gupikanira ntambu yantakuliti kwajili ya pahala panu na wenikaya wakuyi handa hawaweri ushiwa na pangira, su gulinanagaziya na kupapula nguwu zyaku su neni nikupikanira. <verse eid="2KI 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 22:20" />Masu gaku hapeni gawoni ukontola yaniujega kwajili ya pahala panu. Guloli, hanikutul i pamuhera na wambuyi waku nagwenga hagutulwi mlisembi kwa ponga.” Su walagilagi wamjegera mfalumi Yosia visoweru avi.<verse eid="2KI 22:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2KI 23" />
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Yosia kawusiya guwira ya wamlungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 34:3-7">2 Mirandu 34:3-7</ref>,<ref loc="2CH 34:29-33">29-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 23:1" />Shakapanu Mfalumi kawalagaliliti wantu wawajojoniri wakulu woseri wa Yuda na wa Yerusalemu, <verse eid="2KI 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 23:2" />na mfalumi kagenda mu Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu pamuhera na wantu woseri wa Yuda na wenikaya woseri wa Yerusalemu na watambika pamuhera na wambuyi, wantu woseri wadidini kwa wakulu. Su, kawabetulira shitabu sha lipatanu shashiwonikiti mu Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2KI 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 23:3" />Shakapanu mfalumi kagoloka pakwegera pa mpanda na kutenda lipatanu palongolu pa Mtuwa Mlungu, kumfata Mtuwa Mlungu, kukola lagiru zakuyi, matakula na malagaliru gakuyi kwa moyu gwakuyi goseri na kwa rohu yakuyi yoseri, kutenda visoweru vyoseri vya lipatanu vyavilembitwi mushitabu ashi sha lipatanu. Wantu woseri wawera pamuhera kutenda lipatanu.<verse eid="2KI 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 23:4" />Shakapanu Yosia kamgambiziya mtambika mkulu Hilikiya na watambika watanga wakuyi na walolera walaviyi mu Nyumba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu vintu vyavinyawitwi kwaajili ya Baali, Ashera na kwaajili ya sayali, kavipambira kwa motu kunja kwa Yerusalemu mululalanda lwa Kidironi na kujega malivu gakuyi aku Beteli. <verse eid="2KI 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 23:5" />Shakapanu kawawusiya watambika woseri yawasyagulitwi na mfalumi gwa Yuda su kutumiziya ubani pahala pa kuguwira mumiji ya Yuda na kuzyengeta Yerusalemu. Viraa na walii yawatumiziyiti ubani kwa Baali, mshenji na mwezi na ntondu na sayali Mulihekalu lya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2KI 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 23:6" />Kawusiyiti shinyagu sha Ashera kulawa mu Hekalu, kunja ku Yerusalemu, kayijega mpaka lushemba lwa Kidironi. Aku kashipambira kwa motu na kushisaga mpaka shiwera malivu na malivu gakuyi kagapalasiya pampindi pa masembi ga wantu. <verse eid="2KI 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 23:7" />Viravirii kabomoliti numba za wapalu yawaweriti wankutenda uhumba mu Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu, pahala peni wadala wapotiti mapazia ga Ashera. <verse eid="2KI 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 23:8" />Kawajojonira watambika woseri kulawa miji ya Yuda na kuwajega Yerusalemu. Shakapanu katula humba vitalawanda pahala pawalavililiti malaviwu, kulawa Geba mpaka Beeri Sheba. Viravilii kapabomola vitalawanda vyaviweriti uwega wa kumshigi wa ligomi lya mji peni migomi yayiweriti kunjira ya kwingilira ligomi lya Yoshua mkolamlima gwa mji. <verse eid="2KI 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 23:9" />Watambika awa yawajimiritwindiri kutenda lihengu pashitalawanda sha Mtuwa Mlungu mu Yerusalemu, kumbiti waliyiti mabumunda yagalekerwandiri simika gawapananitwi na watambika wayawu.<verse eid="2KI 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 23:10" />Mfalumi Yosia viraa kapahalibisiyiti pahala pa kuguwira wamlungu wa mpayu pahala papashemitwi Tofeti mululalanda lwa wana wa Hinomu, su muntu yoseri nakamlunguziya mwana gwakuyi mpalu ama mhinga kuwera tambiku kwa mlungu Moleki. <verse eid="2KI 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 23:11" />Ntambuiraayi kawusiyiti farasi yawatulitwi na wafalumi wa Yuda yawatenderitwi shaka sha kumguwira mlungu mshenji na kalunguziyiti mbutuka zazitendiritwi mukuguwira, kunjira ya kwingira mu Numba ya Mtuwa Mlungu, pakwegera na pakakala Natani Meleki, yakaweriti mlongozi gwawu mkulu. <verse eid="2KI 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 23:12" />Vitalawanda vyeni wafalumi wa Yuda wanyawiti mshumba kushitwiku sha Ahazi, pamuhera na shitalawanda sheni Manasi kanyawiti mumageleri mawili ga Numba ya Mlungu. Kashibomoliti na kushiposholanga, shakapanu kasiti malivu gakuyi mulushemba lwa Kidironi. <verse eid="2KI 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 23:13" />Viraa mfalumi Yosia kahalibisiya vitalawanda vyavinyawitwi na mfalumi Selemani vyaviweriti uwega wa kwagulawa mshenji mwa Yerusalemu na kugenda uwega wa lugongu lwa uhalibisiya, pahala mfalumi gwa Israeli pakanyawiti kwaajili ya Ashitaroti yakaweriti nkalaliru ya Wasidoni na Kemoshi yakaweriti nkalaliru ya Moabu na viraa kwajili ya Milikomu yakaweriti nkalaliru ya Waamoni. <verse eid="2KI 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 23:14" />Kamegiti mpanda vipandivipandi, viraa kavidumulanga vinyagu vya Ashera na kapadodiziya pahala papaweriti vigoloka vinyagu, kapamemiziyiti mihonju ya wantu.<verse eid="2KI 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 23:15" />Nentu ya aga kapahalibisiyiti aku Beteli pahala pa kuguwira papanyawitwi na mfalumi Yeroboamu mwana gwa Nebeti, yakawatenditi wantu wa Israeli watendi vidoda. Kahalibisiyiti vitalawanda avi na kumeganga mabuwi gakuyi vipandivipandi na shakapanu kaviponda mpaka viwera madikudiku, viraa kalunguziya viraa vinyagu vya Ashera. <verse eid="2KI 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 23:16" />Shakapanu Yosia pakagalambukiti kawoniti masembi pampindi pa shigongu, su kalagaliriti masembi gafukulwi na mihonju ilaviwi na yilunguziwi pampindi pa shitalawanda. Kwakutenda hangu su kashitula humba shitalawanda teratera na shisoweru sha Mtuwa Mlungu, sheni muntu gwa Mlungu kashibweriti, mbuyi yakatungiti malawiru aga. <verse eid="2KI 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 23:17" />Shakapanu mfalumi kakosiya, “Lisembi lyalinyawiti lyaniliwona kulii ndo lya gaa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 23:17">Wantu wa mji wamwankula, “Ndo lisembi lya muntu gwa Mlungu mweni kiziti kulawa Yuda na kutunga mirandu yeni yaguyitenda kwa shitalawanda sha Beteli.”<verse eid="2KI 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 23:18" />Na yomberi kalagalira, “Mulileki panu, muntu yoseri nakawusiya mihonju yakuyi.” Hangu wayilekiti mihonju yakuyi, pamuhera na mihonju ya mbuyi gwa Mlungu yakalawiti Samaria.<verse eid="2KI 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 23:19" />Mukila isi ya Samaria mfalumi Yosia kahalibisiyiti pahala papanyawitwi kwa mabuwi toziya ya kuguwira wamlungu wa mpayu papanyawitwi na wafalumi wa Israeli, su wamtenda Mtuwa Mlungu kakalali. Vitalawanda vyoseri avi kavihalibisiyiti ntambu yakatenditi aku Beteli. <verse eid="2KI 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 23:20" />Kawalagiti watambika woseri wa wamlungu wa mpayu pampindi pa vitalawanda vyawu na kulunguziya mihonju yawu pampindi pa vitalawanda avi. Shakapanu kawuya Yerusalemu.<verse eid="2KI 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yosia Kankutenda msambu gwa Pasaka ya kulihola pawalawiti Misri</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 35:1-19">2 Mirandu 35:1-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 23:21" />“Shakapanu mfalumi kawalagaliriti wantu woseri, pakalonga, mtendi msambu gwa pasaka kwa kumpanana ligoya Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu, ntambu yayilembitwi mushitabu ashi shashiwonikaniti mu Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu.” <verse eid="2KI 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 23:22" />Kwahera Pasaka yainemeliritwi handa ayi kwanjira shaka sha walonguziya yawalongoziyiti Israeli pota shaka sha ufalumi wa Israeli ama wa Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 23:23" />Hangu mushinja sha lirongu na nane sha ukolamlima wa Yosia, Pasaka inemelelitwi kwajili ya ligoya lya Mtuwa Mlungu mu Yerusalemu.<verse eid="2KI 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mirandu yimonga yakatenditi Yosia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 23:24" />Nentu ya aga, mfalumi Yosia kawusiya wakomalera washamshera, yawaguwira wamlungu, vinyagu vya kuguwira na vintu vimonga vyoseri vya kukalaziya vyaviwonekaniti mu Yuda na Yerusalemu. Aga katenditi su kutenda ntambu yayifiruwa kulinganira na lagiru lyalembitwi mushitabu shilii sheni Hilikia mtambika kashiwoniti mngati mu Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2KI 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 23:25" />Pamberi pa mfalumi Yosia na pa yomberi kwahera mfalumi yoseri yakaweriti gambira yomberi, mweni kamtenderiti Mtuwa Mlungu kwa moyu gwakuyi goseri, kwa likakala lyakuyi lyoseri na kwa rohu yakuyi yoseri kulinganira na lagiru ya Musa.<verse eid="2KI 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 23:26" />Kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti kangali kuwakalalira wantu wa Yuda toziya Manasi katenditi vintu vitangala vyavimtenditi kakalali. <verse eid="2KI 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 23:27" />Na yomberi Mtuwa Mlungu kalongiti, “Haniwawingi wantu wa Yuda kulawa palongolu paneni ntambu yantenditi kwa wantu wa Israeli, hunigulemi mji gwa Yerusalemu gweni nigusyaguliti panongiti, litawu lyangu haliweri amu.”<verse eid="2KI 23:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Upeleru wa ukolamlima wa Yosia</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 35:20-36:1">2 Mirandu 35:20-36:1</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 23:28" />Mirandu yoseri yakatenditi Yosia ilembitwi Mushitabu sha Maholu ga Wafalumi wa Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 23:29" />Shaka sha ukolamlima wa Yosia, mfalumi Neku gwa Misri kagenditi mpaka lushemba lwa Eufurate su kaliwoni na mfalumi gwa Ashuru. Mfalumi Yosia kawukiti su kalikomangi na yomberi, kumbiti Farawu Neku pakamwoniti kamlagiti kulii Megidu. <verse eid="2KI 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 23:30" />Wantumintumi wakuyi wapapiti mauti gakuyi mumbutuka na kugawuziya Yerusalemu na kumfintira kulisembi lyakuyi mweni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 23:30">Shakapanu wantu wa Yuda wamtola Yehoahazi mwana gwa Yosia wamswaga lipaki na kumlumika kuwera mfalumi pahala pa tati gwakuyi.<verse eid="2KI 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Yehoahazi gwa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 36:2-4">2 Mirandu 36:2-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 23:31" />Yehoahazi kaweriti na vinja ishilini na vitatu pakanjiti kukolamlima, kakolamlima kwa miyezi mitatu aku Yerusalemu. Mawu gwakuyi wamshemiti Hamutali mhinga gwa Yerimiya kulawa Libina. <verse eid="2KI 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 23:32" />Yehoahazi katenditi makontola kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu handa wambuyi wakuyi ntambu yawatenditi. <verse eid="2KI 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 23:33" />Su nakendereya kukolamlima aku Yerusalemu, Farawu Neku mfalumi gwa Misri kambatiti aku Ribla muisi ya Hamati, kayitoza isi kodi ya elufu tatu na miya msheshi za madini ga feza na kilu selasini na msheshi za zahabu. <verse eid="2KI 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 23:34" />Mfalumi Farawu Neko kamlumika Eliakimu mwana gwa mfalumi Yosia pahala pa tati gwakuyi Yosia, kaligalambula litawu lyakuyi kuwera Yehoyakimu. Kumbiti kamtoliti Yehoahazi kamjegera patali mpaka Misri na kuhowera aku.<verse eid="2KI 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Yehoyakimu gwa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 36:5-8">2 Mirandu 36:5-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 23:35" />Mfalumi Yehoyakimu kampananiti Farao madini ga feza na zahabu, katenditi hangu kwa kuwatoza kodi wantu wakuyi su kawezi kutenda mafiruwa ga Farao ga kupananwa madini ga feza. Kawatoziti wantu madini ga feza na zahabu na kila muntu yumu kalaviyiti shilii shakalongiti mfalumi nayomberi kampananiti Farawu Neko mfalumi gwa Misri.<verse eid="2KI 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 23:36" />Yehoyakimu kaweriti na vinja ishilini na mhanu pakanjiti kukolamlima na kakolitimlima aku Yerusalemu kwa vinja lirongu na shimu. Litawu lya mawu gwakuyi liweriti Zebida mhinga gwa Pedaya kulawa Ruma. <verse eid="2KI 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 23:37" />Yehoyakimu katenditi makontola palongolu pa Mtuwa Mlungu, ntambu yawatenditi wambuyi wakuyi woseri.<verse eid="2KI 23:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2KI 24" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 24:1" />Shaka sha ukolamlima wa Yehoyakimu, Nebukadineza mfalumi gwa Babeli kayikomangiti Yuda na kamkankanikiti Yehoyakimu kamtendiri ntambu yakafiriti yomberi. Yehoyakimu kamtendiriti kwa vinja vitatu, shakapanu kaleka kumjimira na kamgalambuka. <verse eid="2KI 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 24:2" />Su, Mtuwa Mlungu kamjegera vipinga vya Wababuloni na Waaramu na Wamowabu na Waamoni wayikomangi isi ya Yuda kwa vumu na kuyiharibisiya, kulinganira na shisoweru sha Mtuwa Mlungu shakalongiti kwa wantumintumi wakuyi wambuyi. <verse eid="2KI 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 24:3" />Nakaka mirandu ayi iyipatiti isi ya Yuda kwa lagiru lya Mtuwa Mlungu, su kawahamiziyi kulawa palongolu pakuyi, toziya ya vidoda vya mfalumi Manasi na vyoseri vyakatenditi, <verse eid="2KI 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 24:4" />natoziya ya malaga ga wantu yawahera makosa yawagwititi. Mtuwa Mlungu kamlekeziyandiri makosa aga.<verse eid="2KI 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 24:5" />Su mirandu imonga ya Yehoyakimu na goseri gakatenditi galembwa mu Shitabu sha Maholu ga Wafalumi wa Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 24:6" />Yehoyakimu kahowa na mwana gwakuyi Yehoyakini kanjiti kukolamlima.<verse eid="2KI 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 24:7" />Mfalumi gwa Misri kalawakayindiri na mashonta wakuyi muisi mwakuyi, toziya mfalumi gwa Babeli kiyitoliti na kuyikolamlima isi yoseri yayiweriti pasi pa mfalumi gwa Misri pakwanja kwanjira lushemba lwa Misri mpaka lushemba lwa Eufrati.<verse eid="2KI 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Yehoyakini gwa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 36:9-10">2 Mirandu 36:9-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 24:8" />Yehoyakini kaweriti na vinja lirongu nanani pakanjiti kukolamlima, kakolitimlima aku Yerusalemu kwa shaka sha miyezi mitatu. Mawu gwakuyi kaweriti Nehushita mhinga Elinatani, kulawa Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2KI 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 24:9" />Yehoyakini katenditi makontola kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakatenditi tati gwakuyi.<verse eid="2KI 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 24:10" />Shaka ashi lishonta lya Nebukadineza mfalumi gwa Babeli, ligukomanga mji gwa Yerusalemu na kuguzyengeta. <verse eid="2KI 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 24:11" />Shaka mashonta pagaweriti gaguzyengeta mji, Nebukadineza mweni kiziti Yerusalemu, <verse eid="2KI 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 24:12" />na Yehoyakini Mfalumi gwa Yuda, kanyasula mawoku na kulijega mweni kwa mfalumi gwa Babeli, mweni pamuhera na mawu gwakuyi, wantumintumi wakuyi, wakulu na mashonta wakulu. Mfalumi gwa Babeli kamtoliti lopola mushinja sha nani sha kukolamlima kwakuyi. <verse eid="2KI 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 24:13" />Viraa handa Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakalongiti, Nebukadineza katoliti lunda yoseri yayiweriti mngati mu Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu na mngati muliboma. Kameganga vyombu vya zahabu vyeni Selemani mfalumi gwa Israeli kanyawiti. Vyombu avi viweriti mu Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu. <verse eid="2KI 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 24:14" />Nebukadreza kawatoliti wantu woseri wa Yerusalemu, wakulu woseri na wantu woseri yawaweriti wagangamala na wanyawa woseri na waponda vyuma handa lopola na walanga yawu ndo elufi kumi. Kwahera yakasigaliti ila yawaweriti wahushu nakamu muisi.<verse eid="2KI 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 24:15" />Kamtoliti Yehoyakini mpaka Babeli pamuhera na mawu gwakuyi mfalumi, wadala wakuyi mfalumi, wantumintumi wakuyi na wakulu wa isi, woseri awa kawalaviyiti Yerusalemu na kawajegera Babeli. <verse eid="2KI 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 24:16" />Nebukadineza katoliti wantu wagangamala wa Yuda walanga yawu wantu elufu saba pamuhera na wanyawa wagangamala na waponda vyuma,walanga yawu elufu yimu. Woseri awa pawawera wantu wana makakala na yawaweza kulikomanga nkondu.<verse eid="2KI 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 24:17" />Nebukadineza kamlumika Matania, mlongu gwakuyi Yehoyakini, kaweri mfalumi pa yomberi, mfalumi kamgalambuliti litawu lyakuyi kamshema Sedekia.<verse eid="2KI 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Sedekia gwa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 36:11-12">2 Mirandu 36:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:1-3">Yeremia 52:1-3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 24:18" />Sedekia kaweriti na vinja ishilini na yimu pakanjiti kukolamlima, kakolitimlima vinja lirongu na gumu aku Yerusalemu. Mawu gwakuyi kashemitwi Hamutali mhinga gwa Yerimiya, mwenikaya gwa mji gwa Libina. <verse eid="2KI 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 24:19" />Mfalumi Sedekia katenditi makontola kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakatenditi mfalumi Yehoyakimu. <verse eid="2KI 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 24:20" />Mtuwa Mlungu kawakalaliriti nentu wantu wa Yerusalemu na Yuda, ata kawawinga kutali na yomberi.<verse eid="2KI 24:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="2KI 25" />
  <para style="s">Kwagamiziwa kwa Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 36:13-21">2 Mirandu 36:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:3b">Yeremia 52:3b</ref>,<ref loc="JER 52:11">11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 25:1" />Sedekia kamgalambukiti mfalumi Nebukaderaza gwa Babeli, mulishaka lya lirongu lya mwezi gwa lirongu gwa shinja sha tisa sha ukolamlima wakuyi Sedekia, Nebukadineza mfalumi gwa Babeli kasokiti na lishonta lyakuyi, kagukomanga mji gwa Yerusalemu, kaguzyengeta na kunyawa liboma kuguzyengeta. <verse eid="2KI 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 25:2" />Mji gwendereyiti kuzyengetwa mpaka shinja sha kumi na moja sha ukolamlima wa Sedekia. <verse eid="2KI 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 25:3" />Mulishaka lya tisa lya mwezi gwa msheshi njala iweriti nkulu nentu mu mji ata paweritindiri shiboga shoseri kwaajili ya wenikaya wakuyi. <verse eid="2KI 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 25:4" />Su, seemu ya shibambaza sha mji shibomolitwi na wamashonta woseri watuga shaka sha pashiru pawapitira mushiwunga sha mfalumi kuligomi pakati pa vibambaza viwili, wagenda uwega wa Araba, tembera Wababuloni waweriti waguzyengeta mji. <verse eid="2KI 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 25:5" />Kumbiti lishonta lya Wakalidayu limfatiti Mfalumi na kumlopola kululalanda lya Yeriku na mashonta wakuyi woseri wamlekiti na kutuga. <verse eid="2KI 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 25:6" />Su, Wakalidayu wamlopoliti mfalumi Sedekia wamjega kwa mfalumi gwa Babeli aku Ribila na yomberi kamtoza. <verse eid="2KI 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 25:7" />Shakapanu kawalagiti wana wakuyi na Sedekia mweni pakawona, viravilii wipa masu gakuyi. Upeleru wamtawa minyololu na kumjegera Babeli.<verse eid="2KI 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu yankulunguziwa.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="JER 52:12-23">Yeremia 52:12-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 25:8" />Mulishaka lya saba lya mwezi gwa mhanu gwa shinja sha lirongu na tisa sha ukolamlima wa Nebukadineza mfalumi gwa Babeli, Nabuzaradani mlonguziya gwa walolera wa mfalumi, kasokiti Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2KI 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 25:9" />Kayilunguziyiti motu Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu, liboma na numba zoseri za Yerusalemu, iweri nkulu ama ndidika kayilunguziyiti motu. <verse eid="2KI 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 25:10" />Na wamashonta woseri wa Babeli yawaweriti pamuhera na mlonguziya gwa walolera wa mfalumi wabomoliti vibambaza vyavizyengetiti mji gwa Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2KI 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 25:11" />Nebuzaradani mlonguziya gwa walolera wa mfalumi, kawajegiti muwuhamiziya wantu yawaweriti wasigala mumji na woseri yawaweriti waliponiziya kwa mfalumi gwa Babeli pamuhera na wantu wamonga woseri. <verse eid="2KI 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 25:12" />Kumbiti Nebuzadani kalekiti wamu wa wantu yawaweriti wahushu nakamu muisi. Kawalekiti waloleri mizabibu na kulima malambu.<verse eid="2KI 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 25:13" />Wababeloni wamegiti vipandivipandi mpanda za shaba zyeni ziweriti mu Numba ya Mlungu, pamuhera na vikaliru vyakuyi, libilika likulu lya shaba lyaliweriti amu mu Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu, mpaka Babeli. <verse eid="2KI 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 25:14" />Viraavirii watoliti viwiga, vipalira malivu, mikasi na mitera yakatendiriti kulunguziya ubani na vyombu vimonga vyoseri vya shaba vyavitendiritwi muutenderu wa Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu lya Mlungu. <verse eid="2KI 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 25:15" />Watola kila vyetezu na mabakuli. Mlonguziya gwa walolera wa mfalumi kajegiti Babeli kila vyombu vya zahabu na kila vyombu vya feza. <verse eid="2KI 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 25:16" />Shaba yoseri yakatenderiti mfalumi Selemani kunyawira mpanda mbili zilii, bilika nkulu na vikaliru kwajili ya Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu iwezitwindiri kupima kwa utopa. <verse eid="2KI 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 25:17" />Kila mpanda iweriti na utali wa mita nani na pampindi pakuyi paweriti na mtuwi gwa shaba, utali wa kila mtuyi guweriti mita yimu na nukuta ishilini na mhanu. Kila mtuyi guzyengetwa malembiziya ga makomamanga, goseri ga shaba ntitu.<verse eid="2KI 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu wa Yuda wankubatwa lopolwa aku Babeli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="JER 52:24-27">Yeremia 52:24-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 25:18" />Shakapanu Nebuzaradani mlonguziya gwa walolera wa mfalumi wamtoliti lopola Seraya mtambika mkulu, Sefania mtambika gwa pili pamuhera na wanguziya wamonga watatu wa Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu. <verse eid="2KI 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 25:19" />Kamtoliti mlonguziya yumu mumji gweni kaweriti kawalonguziya mashonta kunkondu, pamuhera na wantu mhanu wamanika wa mfalumi weni wawawoniti aku. Viraa, kambatiti mlonguziya mkulu gwa lishonta mweni katuliti maholu ga mashonta pamuhera na wantu sitini wamanika weni kawawoniti Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2KI 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 25:20" />Nebuzaradani mlonguziya gwa walolera kawatoliti wantu awa, kawajega kwa mfalumi gwa Babeli aku Ribila. <verse eid="2KI 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 25:21" />Mfalumi Nebukadineza gwa Babeli kawakomangiti na kuwalaga wantu awa aku Ribila muisi ya Hamati.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 25:21">Hangu wantu wa Yuda watolitwi lopola kunja kuisi yawu.<verse eid="2KI 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gadalia kankuwera mkulu gwa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="JER 40:7-9">Yeremia 40:7-9</ref>,<ref loc="JER 41:1-3">41:1-3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 25:22" />Mfalumi Nebukadineza gwa Babeli kamsyaguliti Gedalia, mzukulu gwa Shafani, kaweri mkolamlima gwa wantu woseri wa Yuda weni wajegwandiri Babeli. <verse eid="2KI 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 25:23" />Shakapanu wakulu woseri wa mashonta pamuhera na wantu wawu pawapikiniliti kuwera mfalumi gwa Babeli kamsyaguliti Gedalia kuwera mkolamlima, wamgenderiti Gedalia aku Mizipa. Wantu awa waweriti Ishimaeli mwana gwa Netania, Yohanani mwana gwa Karea, Seraya mwana gwa Tanihumeti muntu gwa kulawa Netofati na Yezania muntu kulawa Maaka. <verse eid="2KI 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 25:24" />Na Gadalia kalirapa kulongolu kwawu na wantu wawu, kalonga, “Namtira toziya ya wakulu wa Babeloni. Mlikali muisi mumtenderi mfalumi gwa Babeli na mirandu yoseri hayiwagendeli weri.”<verse eid="2KI 25:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 25:25" />Mumwezi gwa saba, Ishimaeli mwana gwa Natania, mzukulu gwa Elishama yakaweriti gwa lukolu lwa shifalumi, kiziti kwa Gedalia pakalikolana na wantu lirongu, kamkomanga Gedalia na kamlaga. Viravirii kawalagiti Wayahudi na Wababeli yawaweriti na yomberi. <verse eid="2KI 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 25:26" />Shakapanu Waisraeli woseri yawaweriti wahushu pamuhera na wakulu wa mashonta, wawukiti wagenda Misri, toziya wawatiriti Wababeli.<verse eid="2KI 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yohakimu kalekeziwa mukutatilwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="JER 52:31-34">Yeremia 52:31-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 25:27" />Mushinja sha selasini na mbili, Evili Merodaki mfalumi gwa Babeli, pakanjiti kukolamlima, shinja shiraashi kamlekeziyiti Yehoyakini mfalumi gwa Yuda na kamlaviya mkutatilwa. Ali liweriti lishaka lya ishilini na saba lya mwezi gwa lirongu na mbili, shaka sha selasini na saba kwanjira Yehoyakini pakatolitwi lopola. <verse eid="2KI 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 25:28" />Kayoweriti na yomberi weri na kumupanana lupenu lya ligoya kuliku wafalumi wamonga yawaweriti pamuhera na yomberi aku Babeli. <verse eid="2KI 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 25:29" />Su, Yehoyakini kagalambula nguwu zakuyi za kutatilwa. Kila lishaka kaweriti kapata shiboga shakuyi kwa mfalumi. <verse eid="2KI 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 25:30" />Kapananwa na mfalumi vintu vyakaweriti kavifira lishaka kwa lishaka, makaliru gakuyi goseri.<verse eid="2KI 25:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 25" />
</usx>